2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Vital Data Research ===
2 CONT ≤p>Reviewed the Household Records from 1748-1760.  There are several Erics Ersson and a few Karin Ersdotters.  However, the only record of Eric Ersson and Karin Ersdotter as a couple are the two people involved in this record as a
2 CONC  couple.  No children are listed, but that is understandable since all children except for Kierstin died as infants.  The parents of all children listed are Eric Ersson and Karin Ersdotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT === Research Notes ===
2 CONT ≤p>Located a birth record for this Eric Ersson.  Father also named Eric Ersson.  Name of mother not listed or cannot be deciphered.≤/p>
