2 CONT ≤p>Possible death record on page 55 of the 1696-1716 Regna Kyrkobok C:2. It translates as "item Nils in Algustorp......70 years old". There is also a Jonas Olufsson from Algustorp, aged 70, on the same page. A brother?≤/p>
