1 OCCU Hemmansägare. (Skall ej sammanblandas med underlagmannen Anders Jacobsson Grubb i Grubbe), Underlagsman, Underlagman
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "One of the earliest contemporary written pieces of evidence for a Bure descendant is from 1507 and names Johan Bure's grandmother's father, Anders Jakobsson. In this document, dated Skellefteå on February 28, 1507
2 CONC , Archbishop Jakob Ulfsson confirms Anders Jakobsson's ownership of the estate Kåge at Bure. The late vicar of Skellefteå, Mr. Anders, had bought this and given it to his illegitimate daughter ("frillodotter"), who was now married
2 CONC  to Anders Jakobsson. According to the [Bure] family book, her name was Malin. This was even though it was against church law. Anders Jakobsson, who is mentioned without title or epithet, had, however, had to pay an unspecified su
2 CONC m of money in consideration to the archbishop for this confirmation." (Bureätten, Sikeborg).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders probably died before 1539, the year of the oldest preserved tax record for Skellefteá (Sikeborg). According to Ulf Lundström, his homestead is later divided into Storkåge 4 (old homestead) and Storkåge 1 (Lundström).
2 CONT
2 CONT The [incorrect] information that appears in older literature and now also online that he was a subordinate (underlagman) in Västerbotten is due to a mix-up with the relative Anders Jakobsson (Grubb) in Grubbe, Umeå, who acted as a
2 CONC  subordinate at the court in 1568 (Sikeborg).
2 CONT
2 CONT Great-great-grandfather of Johan Bure (through his daughter Anna)  wrote the Bure family history (släkt) in the early 1600s.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Dominus Andreas, biography, "Hernösands Stifts Herdaminne" (1925), pp. 298-99, https://runeberg.org/hernosandh/3/0300.html
2 CONT Anders Jacobsson discussed in "De äldsta historiskt säkerställda släktmedlemmarna" section in  "Bureätten" (Bure Family), Sweden Wikipedia https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bureätten
2 CONT "Bure släkt" (Bure family), "Svenskt biografiskt lexikon," https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sbl/Mobil/Artikel/17152
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Jacobsson-198
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 512331 gives the source "Bure" for birth.
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Skellefteå socken 1650-1790," (1997), p. 93 (cited by Sikeborg).
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Bönder och gårdar i Skellefteå socken 1539-1650" (2004), pp. 96-97, Storkåge 4 Granden.
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" USB (2017), person-ID 94.
