2 CONT The De Besche Family Tree
2 CONT
2 CONT Wathier De Besche lived in 1397 in Liege, in Belgium. the De Besche family was of Dutch nobility. He was married to Jeanna De Borne and they had at least one child; Hindrich De Besche, he lived in 1448 in Liege Belgum. Hindrich ma
2 CONC rried Maria DeMontage, they also got a son, whom they called Hindrich. This Hindrich married Johanna DeRoxhelle. They got at least 2 children; Doritgena De Besche and Wilhelm Hindrich, who was the Architect for the Churfurst of Co
2 CONC logne and the Bishop of Liege. He died on October 8 1567 and is buried in the St. Lambert Church in Liege. Wilhelm Hindrich was married and had 3 sons (at least): Pierrot, Hubert and Gillis De Besche. Gillis was also architect and
2 CONC  building master and a tradesman in the town of Liege. He later went to Antwerp and after that to Sweden in the beginning of the 1600's. He travelled with his wife Helena and 2 daughters. His 5 sons came to Sweden between 1596-160
2 CONC 8. Most of them by invitation from Count Karl, later King Karl IX.
2 CONT
2 CONT +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
