2 CONC rappe[1468].  Seigneur de Gournay-sur-Marne et de la Queue.  "Amalricus de Gornaio" donated property previously owned by "Agnes comitissa mater eius, Rogerius frater ipsius Amalrici et Aales uxor eius" to the priory of Notre-Dame 
2 CONC by charter dated [1182/86][1469].  m as her second husband, ALIX Dame de Luzarches, widow of MATHIEU [II] Comte de Beaumont-sur-Oise, daughter of --- (-6 Jan ----).  1161/1186.  "Adeleidis comitissa quondam de Bellomonte nunc aute
