2 CONC t, new ed. 13 volumes in 14. 1910-1959. Reprint in 6 volumes, Gloucester, UK: Alan Sutton Publishing, 2000.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward T. Beaumont, J.P. The Beaumonts in History. A.D. 850-1850. Oxford.
