1 NOTE {geni:about_me} GENETIC GENEALOGY:
2 CONT [https://fmg.ac/publications/journal/vol-15/718-fnd-15-2 The Common Norman Ancestor to the Verdun, Haviland and Battaglia Families]
2 CONT [https://discover.familytreedna.com/y-dna/R-FT66305/notable Verdun haplogroup R-FT66305 on FamilyTreeDNA Discover Tool]
2 CONT
2 CONT
