2 CONT Roger de Beaumont, 2nd Earl of Warwick
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1130 Gundred de Warenne, daughter of William de Warenne, 2nd Earl of Surrey and Elizabeth de Vermandois and had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT William de Beaumont, 3rd Earl of Warwick.
2 CONT
2 CONT Waleran de Beaumont, 4th Earl of Warwick.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry de Beaumont, was Dean of Salisbury in 1205.
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes de Beaumont, married Geoffrey de Clinton, Chamberlain to the King and son of Geoffrey, the founder of Kenilworth Castle and Priory.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret de Beaumont.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gundred de Beaumont, married:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh Bigod, 1st Earl of Norfolk;
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger de Glanville.
2 CONT
