2 CONT ADA DE3 WARENNE (WARREN) (William II de2, Willi am de1) of Huntingdon,
2 CONT daughter of (2) William II de2, [earl of Surrey] and (CL-35) Isabel
2 CONT (Elizabeth) de (Vermandois), (Countess) (Beaumont), was born c irca 1104,
2 CONT died in 1178 and was buried in Kelso, EUROPE. She married in 1139, (M-14)
2 CONT HENRY DE Huntingdons, (EARL) of Huntingdon, England, son of (M-8) Dav id I
2 CONT the Saint, (King) and (CA-3) Maud of (Huntingdons), (Countess) (ST. LIZ),
2 CONT who was born in 1114, died on 12 June 1152 in Scotland, EUROPE, and was
2 CONT bu ried in Kelso, Roxburghshire, Scotland. [26, 25]
2 CONT AR: (89-25, 170-23+, 100-25)
2 CONT a descendant of Charlemagne through six lines
2 CONT Children: See (M-14) Henry de H UNTINGDON, (Earl)Ancestral FileNumber:<AFN> GS4Z-H4
