2 CONT
2 CONT The Conqueror and His Companions: Robert de Beaumont (link now broken)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward T. Beaumont, J.P. The Beaumonts in History. A.D. 850-1850. Oxford.
2 CONT
2 CONT J.R. Planché. The Conqueror and His Companions. London: Tinsley Brothers, 1874.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
