2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Beaumont, Seigneur de Portaudemer was the son of Humphrey de Vieilles, Seigneur de Vielles et Pont-Audemer and Aubreye (?).1 He died on 29 November 1094.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Roger de Beaumont, Seigneur de Portaudemer was also known as Roger de Bellomont, Earl of Mellent.2 He gained the title of Seigneur de Portaudemer.
2 CONT
