1 NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> 9G81-GMROGER DE BEAUMONT, SIRE DE PONTEAUdeMER (Humphrey de Veulles ..., Touroude ..., Torf), born about 1010,succeeded to the family estates in Normandie, as Sire du Ponteaude Mer,Seigneur de Veulles, 
2 CONC Pre'aux, Torville, and du Ponteaitorf, and Seigneurde Beaumont (or Bellomont), by which last name he came to be generallydescribed. By his marriage he greatly increased the possessions andprestige of the family, and he rose to be 
2 CONC one of the most powerful feudalnoblemen of his age in Normandie. When William the Conqueror invadedEngland in 1066, Roger de Beaumont furnished sixty armed vessels for thefleet and was left in charge of the government of Normandie
2 CONC  when theConqueror started on the expedition. He munificently endowed the Abbey ofPre'aux, of which late in life he became a monk; and dying in 1094 atadvanced age, he was buried in this monastery at Ponteaude Mer,Normandie. (P) H
2 CONC e married about 1040, ADELINE DE MEULLANT, daughter andeventually sole heiress of Waleran, Comte de Meullant, a great feudalnobleman of France. She died in 1081. (P) Children .... [see under theirnames]."
2 CONT   --- J Gardner Bartlett, *Newberry Genealogy*, Boston, 1914, p 4-5
2 CONT
2 CONT Roger de BEAUMONT was born about 1010 in "of" Pont Aude Mer, N, France.IGI has abt 1022. So does Roderick W Stuart, *Royalty for Commoners*, 2ndedn, 1992, p 161 (lin 220) He died in 1094. OR: Roger de BELLOMONT
2 CONT "The same thing is true of Beaumont [i.e., the name "may well be Normanor at
2 CONT least French in origin".] There was a Roger de Beaumont recorded in theDomesday Book as holding Sturminster Marshal in Dorset, and this Rogercertainly took his name from Beaumont in Normandie. From Roger descendedthe Counts of Meu
2 CONC lan, the old Earls of Leicester, and the old Earls of
2 CONT Warwick."
2 CONT   --- Leslie Gilbert Pine, *They Came with the Conqueror, A study of themodern
2 CONT descendants of the Normans", London (Evans Brothers Ltd) 1954, p106-107[Custer February 1, 2002 Family Tree.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT [merge G675.FTW]
2 CONT
