2 CONC dition.  Hemunificently endowed the Abbey of Pre'aux, of which late in life hebecame a monk; and dying in 1094 at advanced age, he was buried in thismonastery at Ponteaudemer, Normandy.  (P) He married about 1040, ADELINEDE MEULLA
