2 CONC t it's properly referenced):
2 CONT
2 CONT Adele de Vermandois was not d/o William I "the Conqueror"
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also probably not d/o RAOUL de Crépy Comte du Vexin et de Valois & his first wife Aelis de Bar-sur-Aube
