2 CONT Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #103173, b. 1057, d. 18 October 1102
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=7 Feb 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois was born in 1057. He was the son of Henri I, Roi de France and Anne of Kiev.2,3 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Aelis de Vermandois, Comtesse de Vermandois, daughter of Heribert V, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois and Adele de Crépi, circa 1080.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 October 1102 at Tarsus.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois was a member of the House of Capet. Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois also went by the nick-name of Hugh 'le Grand'.3 
2 CONT
2 CONT He gained the title of Comte de Vermandois. He gained the title of Comte de Valois.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermandois et de Valois and Aelis de Vermandois, Comtesse de Vermandois
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Elizabeth de Vermandois+1 d. 17 Feb 1131
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
