1 NOTE He was the leader of the first Crusade.  Called the Great, duke of France.
1 NOTE Hugh was one of the illustrious seven leaders of the first crusade. Hewas Duke of France and Burgundy, Marquise of Orleans, Count of Valois andVermandois.
2 CONT Sources:  Browning's Colonial Dames of Royal Descent, pp. 28, 277-8.
