1 NOTE Duke of France and Burgundy; Marquis of Orleans and Count of Amiens,Chaumont, Paris, Valois and Vermandois.  Hugh was a leader in thefirst crusade.
1 NOTE Hugh de Crepi or Magnus, The Great, Count of Vermandois
