1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 2-2438
1 NOTE KNOWN AS "HUGH THE GREAT"; DUKE OF FRANCE & BURGUNDY; LEADER OF THE 1ST
2 CONT CRUSADE; MARQUIS OF ORLEANS; COUNT OF AMIENS, CHAUMONT, PARIS, VALOIS,
2 CONT VERMANDOIS
1 NOTE !    (1) Pedigree in Visitation of Cornwall, Vivian ed., 1887, p.105
2 CONT     (2) Royal Ancestors
