2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Anseau de Garlande, senechal de France, married Agnès de Rochefort Montlhéry, daughter of Guy "le Rouge" de Montlhéry, senechal de France and Elizabeth, dame de Crécy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anseau, seigneur de Gournay-sur-Marne, was seneschal of France after July 1108.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anseau died during the third siege of the chateau du Puiset.
