1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Simon I de Montfort, Seigneur de Montofort-l'Amaury
2 CONT
2 CONT born 1014-1025, died 25 Sept 1087
2 CONT
2 CONT married (1) Isabelle "Bardoul" de Broyes or de Nogent
2 CONT
