2 CONT 5. HUMPHREY3 DE VEULLES (Tourade de PONTAUDEMER2, Torf1),
2 CONT
2 CONT son of (2) Tourade2 and Eva (de CREPON) PONTAUDEMER, 
2 CONT
2 CONT was born circa 980[100], and was buried in Preaux Abbey, Ponteaudemer, Normandy, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married circa 1005, AUBEREE DE LA HAYE, who died circa 1045[100]. [68, 27, 103, 113]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 12 i. ROBERT4 DE BEAUMONT, b. circa 1005. 
2 CONT
2 CONT + 13 ii. COUNT ROGER DE BEAUMONT of Ponteaudemer, b. circa 1022, d. in 1094; m. (ZN-2) COUNTESS ADELIZA DE MEULENT circa 1040. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. JOSCELINE3 DE PONTAUDEMER (Tourade2, Torf1), daughter of (2) Tourade2 and Eva (de CREPON) PONTAUDEMER, was born between 964 and 980, and died between 994 and 1090. She married in 994, (AAL-3) HUGUES DE MONTGOMERY[31], son of (
2 CONC AAL-2) Roger MONTGOMERY. [31]
2 CONT
2 CONT Child: See (AAL-3) Hugues de MONTGOMERY
