2 CONT * Sources differ as to Aubreye (Auberée, Aubrey)'s parentage. '''FMG (Cawley Medieval Lands Database)  leaves her parents unknown.  Others say that she is a de la Haye. ''' 
2 CONT * Her birth date is unknown.  Michael Stanhope's source gives her death date as December 28, 1045.
2 CONT * She married Honfroi (Humphrey) de Vieilles.   Their children were:
2 CONT >#  'Rodbertus de Bellomonte, filius Unfredi.' 
2 CONT >#  Guillaume de Bellomonte, who gave to Saint-Léger de Préaux la forêt de Beaumont. 
2 CONT >#  Roger de Beaumont, (Roger de Vieilles "Barbatus" [de Beaumont]) alias Belomonte, Baron de Beaumesnil, who married Adeline, ADELINE de Meulan, daughter of GALERAN [III] Comte de Meulan & his first wife Ode, sister of Hugues II,
2 CONC  Comte de Meulan
2 CONT ># Dunelme, a daughter, who married and had a daughter
