1 NOTE {geni:about_me} IMPORTANT NOTE: This Adelais, who married Herbert de Vermandois should NOT be confused with her sister Adela (Alix) de Valois & du Vexin who married Thibaut III Comte de Blois, Chartres & Champagne.
