2 CONT The family of Henri Ier de FRANCE and Anne de KIEV ou de RUSSIE
2 CONT
2 CONT [10404] FRANCE (de), Henri Ier (Robert II le Pieux & Constance de PROVENCE [10405]), roi de France, born about 1005, died 1060-08-04 Vitry-aux-Loges (Loiret : 450346), France, buried Saint-Denis (Seine-Saint-Denis : 930066), Franc
2 CONC e
2 CONT
2 CONT married 1051-05-19 Reims (Marne : 510454), France
2 CONT
2 CONT KIEV ou de RUSSIE (de), Anne (..)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Philippe Ier, roi de France, born 1053, died 1108-07-29 Melun (Seine-et-Marne : 770288), France, buried Saint-Benoît-sur-Loire (Loiret : 450270), France, married .. (France) 1071 or 1073 Berthe de HOLLANDE
