2 CONT Gundred (c. 1063 – 1085), wife of William de Warenne (c. 1055 – 1088), was formerly thought of as being yet another of Matilda's daughters, with speculation that she was William I's full daughter, a stepdaughter, or even a foundli
2 CONC ng or adopted daughter. However, this connection to William I has now been firmly debunked.
2 CONT
