2 CONT      William I de Warenne, 1st Earl of Surrey was the son of Rudolph de Warenne and Beatrice (?). He married Gundreda (?).1 He died on 24 June 1088.
2 CONT      William I de Warenne, 1st Earl of Surrey was created 1st Earl of Surrey [England] circa 16 April 1088.1 Child of William I de Warenne, 1st Earl of Surrey and Gundreda (?) William II de Warenne, 2nd Earl of Surrey+2 d. c 11 Ma
