2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Touroude was also called Turulf de Pont Audemer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Touroude de Torville , seigneur de Pont Audemer, married Seinfreda de Crepon, daughter of Herbastus de Crepon Sr., circa 950--presumably when he was a small child. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Touroude was a forester in the area of St. Vaast d'Equiqueville. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Duvelina de Crepon, daughter of Herbastus de Crepon Sr., before 975. 
2 CONT
2 CONT See "My Lines" 
