2 CONT Otto or Odo of Vermandois, died May 25 in 1045, was Count of Vermandois from 1010 to 1045. He was the son of Herbert III, Count of Vermandois, and Ermengearde.
2 CONT
2 CONT On July 15, 1010, he succeeded his brother Albert II who had renounced the county.
2 CONT
2 CONT It would have married a Pavia of unknown origin They were:
