1 NOTE Otto (or Eudes) of Vermandois (29 August 979 - 25 May 1045), Count of Vermandois, was the son of Herbert III, Count of Vermandois and Ermengarde of Bar-sur-Seine. He succeeded in 1021 as count of Vermandois. Otto donated property 
2 CONC to Notre-Dame de Homblières by charter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family and children
2 CONT He married Pavia (or Patia) (b. 990). Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert IV of Vermandois. 
2 CONT Simon (-after 1076), Seigneur de Ham. 
2 CONT Peter of Vermandois. He is shown by Brandenburg as the son of Comte Eudes. 
