2 CONT   NAME Ingrid (Ingegerda) Princess Of /SWEDEN/
1 NOTE [large-G675.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT "Ancestral roots of certain American colonists who came to America before1700", Weis, 1992, seventh edition.
2 CONT "Royalty for Commoners", Roderick W. Stuart, 1992, 2nd edition.
