2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------
2 CONT "Constance d'Arles - also known as Constance de Provence [ .. ] fille de Guillaume Ier (c.950-†993) comte d’Arles, et Adélaïde d'Anjou (†1026)"
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of  Guillaume Ier d'Arles (William I, count of Provence) and Adelais of Anjou, daughter of Fulk II of Anjou
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Constance and Robert had seven children:
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. Advisa, Countess of Auxerre (c. 1003 – after 1063), married Count Renaud I of Nevers
2 CONT
2 CONT    2. Hugh Magnus, co-king (1007 – 17 September 1025)
2 CONT
2 CONT    3. Henri (4 May 1008 – 4 August 1060)
2 CONT
2 CONT    4. Adela, Countess of Contenance (1009 – 5 June 1063), married (1) Duke Richard III of Normandy (2) Count Baldwin V of Flanders
2 CONT
2 CONT    5. Robert I, Duke of Burgundy (1011 – 21 March 1076)
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. Eudes (1013–1056)
2 CONT
2 CONT    7. Constance (born 1014, date of death unknown), married Manasses de Dammartin
2 CONT
2 CONT Enfants:
2 CONT
2 CONT Constance et Robert ont sept enfants :
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Advisa, comtesse d'Auxerre, (c.1003 - après 1063), épouse le comte Renaud Ier de Nevers
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Hugues (1007 - 17 septembre 1025), associé au trône par son père (1017), mais qui meurt prématurément.
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Henri (4 mai, 1008 - 4 août, 1060)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Adèle de France, comtesse de Contenance (1009 - 5 juin, 1063), épouse le duc Richard III de Normandie, puis le comte Baudouin V de Flandre
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Robert Ier de Bourgogne (1011 - 21 mars, 1076)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Eudes (1013 - 1056)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Constance (1014- ?), épouse le comte Manassès de Dammartin. Ce mariage fait entrer les terres de Dammartin, aux bords des terres royales, au sein de la Maison de Montdidier, créant la Maison de Dammartin-Montdidier. A cette 
2 CONC occasion, Dammartin est érigé en comté.
2 CONT
2 CONT Constance d'Arles 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #103099, b. circa 973, d. 25 July 1032
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=19 Jun 2005
2 CONT
2 CONT Constance d'Arles was born circa 973. She was the daughter of Guillaume III Taillefer, Comte de Provence and Adelaide d'Anjou. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert II, Roi de France, son of Hugues de Paris, Roi de France and Adelaide de Poitou, in 1003. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was also reported to have been married circa 1000. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 25 July 1032.
2 CONT
2 CONT Constance d'Arles was also known as Constance de Taillefer. (2)
2 CONT
