2 CONT Bertha de Bourgogne was born circa 962. She was the daughter of Conrad, Roi de Jurane Bourgogne and Elfgifu (?).2 She married, firstly, Eudes I, Comte de Champagne circa 983. She married, secondly, Robert II, Roi de France, son of
2 CONC  Hugues de Paris, Roi de France and Adelaide de Poitou, in 996. She and Robert II, Roi de France were divorced in 1000.2 She died after 1035.
