2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT In 1001, Robert entered into his final and longest-lasting marriage to Constance of Arles, the daughter of William I of Provence. She was an ambitious and scheming woman, who made life miserable for her husband by encouraging her 
2 CONC sons to revolt against their father.
