1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ROBERT de France (Orléans ([27 Mar] 972-Château de Melun 20 Jul 1031, bur église de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis).
2 CONT s/o  HUGUES “Capet” King of France & wife Adelais [de Poitou]
2 CONT x (988, before 1 Apr, repudiated [991/92] as her second husband, ROZALA [Suzanne] di Ivrea, widow of ARNOUL II “le Jeune” Count of Flanders, d/o BERENGARIO II ex-King of Italy [Ivrea] & Willa of Tuscany-Arles ([950/960]-13 Dec 100
2 CONC 3 or 7 Feb 1004, bur Gent, church of the Abbey de Saint-Pierre du Mont-Blandin)
2 CONT xx ([late 996/early 997], divorced Sep 1001) BERTHE of Burgundy, widow of EUDES I Comte de Blois et de Chartres, daughter of CONRAD I “le Pacifique” King of Burgundy [Welf] & Mathilde de France [Carolingian] ([964/965]-16 Jan afte
2 CONC r 1010).
2 CONT xxx (after Sep 1001 before 25 Aug 1003) CONSTANCE d'Arles, d/o  GUILLAUME II “le Libérateur” Comte d’Arles [Provence] et Marquis & his second wife Adelais [Blanche] d’Anjou ([987/89]-Château de Melun 22 or 25 Jul 1032, bur église 
2 CONC de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis). 
2 CONT 1. [CONSTANCE?]
2 CONT 2.         HEDWIGE [Avoie] de France ([1003]-5 Jun after 1063). 
2 CONT 3.         HUGUES de France (1007-28 Aug 1025, bur Compiègne, church of the Abbaye de Saint-Corneille).
2 CONT 4.         HENRI de France ([end 1009/May 1010]-Palais de Vitry-aux-Loges, forêt d’Orléans, Loiret 4 Aug 1060, bur église de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis).
2 CONT 5.         ROBERT de France ([1011/12]-church of Fleury-sur-Ouche, Côte d’Or 18 Mar 1076, bur Saint-Seine-l'Abbaye, Côte d’Or).  
2 CONT 6.         EUDES de France ([1013]-Germigny-des-Prés, near Sully, Loiret 15 May [1057/59]).
2 CONT 7.         ADELA de France (-Messines 8 Jan 1079, bur Messines, Benedictine monastery).  
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Hugues-Capet-roi-des-Francs/5411162384740027078 HUGUES], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Hugh-of-Paris-count-of-Paris-duke-of-the-Franks/348989271720012699?through=5411162384740027078 HUGUES “le Gr
2 CONC and” Duc des Francs] & his third wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Hedwige-of-Saxony/6000000003726054418?through=5411162384740027078 Hedwig of Germany] ([940]-villa "Les Juifs", near Prasville, Eure-et-Loire 24 Oct 996, bur église
2 CONC  de l'Abbaye royale de Saint-Denis).  The Historia Francorum Senonensis names (in order) "Hugo, Otto et Heinricus" as the three sons of "Hugo Magnus dux Francorum…ex filia Odonis regis"[142].  Flodoard names "Hugonem et Oddonem cl
