2 CONC  her second husband, and became one of the principal advisers of her son Count Baldwin IV.  France retained Montreuil-sur-Mer.  "Susanna regina cum filio suo Baldwino" donated "alodem suum…Atingehem…et in Testereph" to Saint-Pierr
