2 CONC di comitis Nivernensis uxorem" as the daughter of King Robert and his wife Constance[226].  The Historia Nivernensium Comitum records that the wife of "Renaldum" was "sorori Regis Roberti, filii Hugonis Capitonis"[227].  The Annal
