2 CONT King of France, 1 Jan 996-1031; Count of Paris.Capet, Robert II the Piousof France, King of France
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 27 MAR 972, Orléans, France
2 CONT Acceded: 996
2 CONT Died: 1031
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Capet, Hugh, King of France, b. ABT 938
2 CONT
2 CONT
