2 CONC chbishop Robert" by Orderic Vitalis[2568].  m (after 17 Jun [1040]) as her second husband, HAWISE, widow of ROBERT de Grantmesnil, daughter of GIROIE & his wife Gisla de Bastenbourg (-10 May ----).  Guillaume of Jumièges records t
2 CONC hat “Richardus Ebroicensis comes...Willelmus...frater eius” married “Hadevisam filia Geroii relictam Roberti de Grentemaisnil”[2569].  Orderic Vitalis records that "Geroius" married “Gislam Turstini de Basteburgo filiam” by whom h
