2 CONT ===Notes  
2 CONT * We don’t know the name of the '''dame de Nogent'''. There is no primary source found for the name “Albreda.”.
2 CONT * She was “the heiress of Montfort”;  “Montfort de Esperon,” and also known as “(Miss) de Nogent-le Rotrou.”
2 CONT * Birth estimated as the year 969.  Death seen as after 1022.
2 CONT *She is seen as the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Hughes-de-Nogent-II-Lord-of-Montfort/6000000030227858758?through=6000000031928221957 & https://www.geni.com/people/Judith-De-Nogent/6000000033360021253?through=6000000031
2 CONC 928221957
2 CONT * It is speculated that she first married to https://www.geni.com/people/Hugues-de-Beauvais-seigneur-de-Nogent/6000000017043598398, no children;  and married Guillaume after his assassination in May of 1008.
2 CONT * She is seen as https://www.geni.com/people/Hugues-de-Blois-dit-de-Beauvais/6000000017043598398?through=6000000031928221957’s daughter (rather than widow) by a wife https://www.geni.com/people/Brigantine-de-Montfort/6000000009305
2 CONC 009149?through=5374720036760025391.  This seems unlikely, as he was not known to have children.
2 CONT
