2 CONT # Bijard, Raphael.  ''Hugues de Beauvais : le comte palatin de l'an Mil''  (Dernière édition : 29 décembre 2023) < [https://www.academia.edu/39227545/Hugues_de_Beauvais_le_comte_palatin_de_lan_Mil academia.edu] >”Hugh of Beauvais 
2 CONC loyal to king Robert II was count palatine until his murder likely in July 1007. Kinsman to Roger of Blois and Helvise of Pithiviers, Hugh was indeed a member of the potent house of Blois. The current publication aims at identifyi
2 CONC ng its family origins based on the scarce evidence left. The honores he endorsed and the places where he played a major role provide useful information about these origins but also give an insight about the lordship he was about t
