2 CONT Rotrou de Chateaudun I, died 1079. He was the son of 24. Geoffrey de Chateaudun I and 25. Heloise de Mortaigne. He married 13. Adeline Domfront.
2 CONT
2 CONT  13. Adeline Domfront She was the daughter of 26. Guerin de Domfront.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rotrou de Chateaudun and Adeline Domfront are:
2 CONT
2 CONT   i. Hugh de Chateaudun, married Agnes de Preteval.
2 CONT
2 CONT  6 ii. Geoffrey du Perche et Mortaigne I, died 1100; married Beatrice de Montdidier.
