2 CONT
2 CONT  Hildouin de Montdidier, died 1063. He was the son of 28. Hildouin de Montdidier et Rameru III and 29. Lesseline ?. He married 15. Alice de Roucy.
2 CONT
2 CONT  15. Alice de Roucy, died 1063. She was the daughter of 30. Ebles de Roucy and 31. Beatrix of Hainault.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hildouin de Montdidier and Alice de Roucy are:
2 CONT
2 CONT   i. Marguerita de Roucy et Montdidier, born Abt. 1045; died Abt. 1110; married Hugh of Clermont I Abt. 1065 in Picardy, France; born Abt. 1030 in Clermont, Oise, France; died Abt. 1102.
2 CONT
2 CONT   ii. Ebles de Roucy et Montdidier, married Sybilla de Hauteville; died Abt. 1090.
2 CONT
2 CONT  7 iii. Beatrice de Montdidier, married Geoffrey du Perche et Mortaigne I.
2 CONT
2 CONT   iv. Felicia de Roucy et Montdidier, died 14 April 1086; married Sancho-Ramirez de Aragon, IV, V 1063; died 4 June 1094.
2 CONT
2 CONT   v. Adelheid de Roucy et Montdidier, born Abt. 1050 in La Sarraz, Waadt, Switzerland; married (1) Gauthier de Roeux; married (2) Falko Conan de Grandison; born Abt. 1050 in La Sarraz, Waadt, Switzerland; died 1114.
2 CONT
2 CONT   vi. Andre de Roucy et Montdidier, married Agnes de Brainne.
