2 CONT Hildouin IV de Montdidier Seigneur De Rameru
2 CONT
2 CONT M, b. 1000, d. 1062
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited	20 Sep 2006
2 CONT
2 CONT Name Variation	Hildouin IV de Montdidier Seigneur De Rameru was also known as Hildouin IV, Count de Montdidier. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth*	He was born in 1000 in Montdidier, Somme, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage*	He married Alice (Adela) de Roucy, daughter of Ebles I, de Roucy , Count of Reims and Bâeatrice, Countess of Hainault, in 1031. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death*	Hildouin IV de Montdidier Seigneur De Rameru died in 1062. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT 	Alice (Adela) de Roucy b. circa 1014, d. 1063
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Margaret (Marguerite) De Montdidier+ b. c 1045, d. c 1110
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hilduin was also called Hilduin I de Roucy, and Hildouin d'Arcis-sur-Aube.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Alix, comtesse de Roucy, daughter of Ebles I, comte de Reims & de Roucy and Beatrix de Hainaut, in 1031.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hilduin died in 1063 at the age of 53 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT See "My Lines"
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p346.htm#i5683 )
2 CONT
2 CONT from Compiler: R. B. Stewart, Evans, GA
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/index.htm )
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT From http://www.rpi.edu/~holmes/Hobbies/Genealogy/ps06/ps06_480.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~`
2 CONT
2 CONT Hilduin IV became Count of Roucy and Montdidier through his marriage with Adela. "Europaische Stammtafeln," Band III, gives his death year as 1061.
2 CONT
2 CONT Montdidier is a town in northern France which dates from the Merovingian period, perhaps deriving its name from the imprisonment of Lombard king Didier there in the 8th Century - it is on a hill on the Don river. See "Genealogist,
2 CONC " X:85. Hildouin de Rameru was also Count of Roucy in right of his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cokayne's "Complete Peerage" (Chester, p.165), identifies him as 
2 CONT
2 CONT MARGARET's father. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Count of Montdidier and Roucy. Weis' "Ancestral Roots . . ." (111:25), 
2 CONT
2 CONT (149:22A), (151:22), has him as Hilduin III. (246:22) refers to him as 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hildouin de Ramerau. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Stuart's "Royalty For Commoners" (95:31), (170:31) & (266:31) call him 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hilduin IV. 
2 CONT
2 CONT References: [PlantagenetA],[PresidentsA],[ES],[AR7]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hildouin III de Montdidier was the IV Count de Montdidier.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/aqwg740.htm#12138
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hildouin III de RAMERU Count of Montdidier''' [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 was born 1010 in Ramerupt, Aube, France. He died 1063 in Montdidier, Somme, Picardie, France. Hildouin married Adele de ROUCY on 1031 in Montdidier,
2 CONC  Somme, Picardie, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Adele de ROUCY [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 was born 1019 in Roucy, Aisne, France. She died 1062 in Montdidier, Somme, Picardie, France. Adele married Hildouin III de RAMERU Count of Montdidier on 1031 in Montdidier, Somme, Picardie, F
2 CONC rance.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT #  F i Adela de MONTDIDIER was born 1041. 
2 CONT #  M ii Ebles II de ROUCY Count of Roucy was born 1045 and died May 1103. 
2 CONT #  F iii Marguerite de ROUCY was born 1049 and died 1110. 
2 CONT #  F iv Felice de MONTDIDIER was born 1051 and died 24 Apr 1096. 
2 CONT #  F v Beatrix de MONTDIDIER was born 1054 and died after 5 Aug 1128. 
2 CONT #  M vi Andre de MONTDIDIER Sire de Ramerupt was born 1058 and died 19 Jul 1142. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hilduin was Seigneur of Ramerupt and Count of Montdidier, and by marriage he was Count of Roucy.
2 CONT
