2 CONT I Ebles , Count De Roucy [Parents] [1], [2] was born [3], [4] WFT Est 957-1011 in OF REIMS, MARNE, FRANCE. He died [5], [6] on 11 May 1033. He married [7], [8] Beatrice Of Hainault WFT Est 985-1047.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrice Of Hainault [Parents] [1], [2] was born [3], [4] about 998 in OF HAINAULT, HOLLAND. She died [5], [6] WFT Est 991-1099. She married [7], [8] I Ebles , Count De Roucy WFT Est 985-1047.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *1. F 	i 	Countess Of Rouci (Roucy) Adela\Alice was born WFT Est 990-1031. She died WFT Est 1025-1113. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~guyasims/pafg111.htm#2090sg64ye435swg
2 CONT
2 CONT IV Hildwin\Hildouin , Count Of Montdidier [Parents] [1], [2] was born [3], [4] WFT Est 983-1028 in (Lord of Rouci (Roucy))OF MONTDIDIER, SOMME, FRANCE. He married [5], [6] Countess Of Rouci (Roucy) Adela\Alice WFT Est 1008-1063. T
2 CONC hey were married about 1031.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Notes] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Countess Of Rouci (Roucy) Adela\Alice [Parents] 1, 2 was born 3, 4 WFT Est 990-1031 in OF ROUCY, AISNE, FRANCE. She died 5, 6 WFT Est 1025-1113. She married 7, 8 IV Hildwin\Hildouin , Count Of Montdidier WFT Est 1008-1063. They we
2 CONC re married about 1031.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *1. F 	i 	Marguerita de Roucy was born WFT Est 1024-1056. She died WFT Est 1062-1139.
2 CONT *2. M 	ii 	Andre De Roucy , Lord Of Rameru was born WFT Est 1025-1076. He died WFT Est 1064-1154.
2 CONT *3. F 	iii 	Beatrice de Montdidier was born in 1047. She died on 2 Sep 1129. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Hildouin de Montdidier, died 1063. He was the son of 28. Hildouin de Montdidier et Rameru III and 29. Lesseline ?. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 15. Alice de Roucy.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. Alice de Roucy, died 1063. She was the daughter of 30. Ebles de Roucy and 31. Beatrix of Hainault.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hildouin de Montdidier and Alice de Roucy are:
2 CONT *1. i. Marguerita de Roucy et Montdidier, born Abt. 1045; died Abt. 1110; married Hugh of Clermont I Abt. 1065 in Picardy, France; born Abt. 1030 in Clermont, Oise, France; died Abt. 1102.
2 CONT *2.  ii. Ebles de Roucy et Montdidier, married Sybilla de Hauteville; died Abt. 1090.
2 CONT *3. 7 iii. Beatrice de Montdidier, married Geoffrey du Perche et Mortaigne I.
2 CONT *4.  iv. Felicia de Roucy et Montdidier, died 14 April 1086; married Sancho-Ramirez de Aragon, IV, V 1063; died 4 June 1094.
2 CONT *5. v. Adelheid de Roucy et Montdidier, born Abt. 1050 in La Sarraz, Waadt, Switzerland; married (1) Gauthier de Roeux; married (2) Falko Conan de Grandison; born Abt. 1050 in La Sarraz, Waadt, Switzerland; died 1114.
2 CONT *6. vi. Andre de Roucy et Montdidier, married Agnes de Brainne.
