1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MARGUERITE de Ramerupt de Roucy, daughter of Hilduin IV de Ramerupt, Comte [de Montdidier], Seigneur de Ramerupt, and Adelaide de Roucy
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/chamdampjo.htm#_Toc494628372
2 CONT
2 CONT The Genealogiæ Scriptoris Fusniacensis names "secundam filiam comitis Helduini de Rameruth dictam Margaretam" as wife of "Hugo comes de Claro-monte"[660].  The Chronicle of Alberic de Trois-Fontaines names "Margareta" as third dau
2 CONC ghter of Hilduin Comte de Roucy and names her husband "comiti Hugonis de Claromonte Baluacensi"[661].  m HUGUES de Clermont [en-Beauvaisis] dit de Mouchy, son of RENAUD Camerarius & his wife Ermentrude --- (-after Nov 1099). 
2 CONT =-------------------------------------=
2 CONT
2 CONT Proof: The American Genealogist, 57:32; AR., op. cit., pp.131, 206.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite de ROUCI (1035-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Hilduin IV de ROUCI Seigneur de Ramem, d'Arcis (-1063) and Adelaide de RHIEMS
2 CONT
2 CONT     b. ABT 1035
2 CONT     r. Montdidier, Somme, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Hugh de Creil Count of Clermont in Beauvaisis Count de Clermont (1030-1101)
2 CONT
2 CONT References: 
2 CONT 1. "Ancestors of American Presidents", Gary Boyd Roberts. 2. "Ancestral roots of certain American colonists who came to America before 1700", Frederick Lewis Weis, 1992, seventh edition. The earlier editions were called: "Ancestra
2 CONC l roots of sixty colonists who came to New England 1623-1650"
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT child 1: Renaud II De Clermont-En-Beauvaisis BIRTH Clermont, France DEATH 1162 child 2: Hermentrude De Clermont BIRTH 1058 Clermont,France child 3: Alice De Clermont BIRTH 1058 Northamptonshire, England DEATH 1117 England  child 4
2 CONC : Richilde De Creil Child 5: Hermentrude De Clermont BIRTH 1058 Clermont,France
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lady Marguerite was Countess of Clermont-en-Beauvaisis.
