2 CONT Adelaide De Gournay 
2 CONT Adelaide was born about 1015 in Gournay-en-Bray, Seine-Inferieure, Normandy, France.1   Adelaide's father was Hugh II De Gournay and her mother was Albrada Wife Of Hugh II De Gournay.  Her paternal grandparents were Renaud De Gour
2 CONC nay and Alberada Wife Of Renaud De Gournay. She had a brother named Hugh III.  She was the older of the two children.  She died on April 8th, 1099.1 
