2 CONT
2 CONT Father Bernard the Saxon2 b. 904
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Sprote de Bourgogne1 b. 908
2 CONT
2 CONT Also called Torf "the Rich" de Harcourt.2 Seigneur de Pont-Audemer Torf de Torville was born in 920.3 He was born in 928.1 He was the son of Bernard the Saxon and Sprote de Bourgogne.2,1 Seigneur de Pont-Audemer Torf de Torville w
2 CONC as is noted as "a Norman founder". He married Ermenberge de Bricquebec.1 Seigneur de Pont-Audemer Torf de Torville died circa 1010.3
