1 NOTE Herbert III of Vermandois (953 - 1015), Count of Vermandois, was the son of Adalbert I of Vermandois and Gerberge of Lorraine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT He married Ermengard of Bar (946 - after 1035), but his first two children were by Eadgifu of England, daughter of Edward I "The Elder"; widow of Charles III "The Simple" (per Ancestral Roots of Certain American Colonists Who Came
2 CONC  to America Before 1700 by Frederick Lewis Weis, Line 50-20).
2 CONT
2 CONT Adalbert II of Vermandois (ca. 980-1015) 
2 CONT Landulf, Bishop of Noyon 
2 CONT Otto, Count of Vermandois (ca. 1000-1045) 
