2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Oleg Łatyszonek, Ales’ Bely. On the Scandinavian origin of Rahvalod // Annus Albaruthenicus/Год беларускі №6. 2005 - https://web.archive.org/web/20070702031739/http://kamunikat.fontel.net/www/czasopisy/annus/2005/03.htm
