2 CONT References[edit] Herman Lindqvist: "Historien om Sveriges drottningar" (History of the queens of Sweden) (2006) (In Swedish) Åke Ohlmarks: "Alla Sveriges drottningar" (All the queens of Sweden) (In Swedish) Snorri Sturluson
