2 CONT Adelaide d'Anjou was the daughter of Fulk II d'Anjou, Comte d'Anjou and Gerberge de Tours. She married Guillaume III Taillefer, Comte de Provence, son of Raimond III Pons, Comte de Toulouse and Gersende (?). (Ben M. Angel notes: T
2 CONC his is in error. She married instead Guillaume II Le Liberateur, Comte d'Arles, among others.)
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before 990.
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelaide d'Anjou was also known as Arsinde d'Anjou .
2 CONT
