2 CONT      Adelaide d'Anjou was the daughter of Fulk II d'Anjou, Comte d'Anjou and Gerberge de Tours. She married Guillaume III Taillefer, Comte de Provence, son of Raimond III Pons, Comte de Toulouse and Gersende (?). She died before 9
2 CONC 90.
2 CONT      Adelaide d'Anjou was also known as Arsinde d'Anjou. Child of Adelaide d'Anjou and Guillaume III Taillefer, Comte de Provence
