2 CONT
2 CONT >'''Adélaïde de Poitou d'Aquitaine'''
2 CONT >'''Parents''': Guillaume 'Tête d'étoupe' III d'Aquitaine & Geirlaug Adela de Normandie
2 CONT >'''Spouse''': Hugues Capet, Roi de France
2 CONT >Children:
2 CONT >'''1.''' Gisèle, Countess of Ponthieu(c. 970–1002), wife of Hugh I, Count of Ponthieu
2 CONT >'''2.''' Hedwig, Countess of Mons (or Hadevide, or Avoise) (c. 969–after 1013), wife of Reginar IV, Count of Mons
2 CONT >'''3.''' Robert II (972–1031), the future king of France. 
2 CONT
