2 CONT
2 CONT Queen of France between 972 and 1006.
2 CONT
2 CONT 987-96 Joint Ruler Queen Alais d'Aquitaine of France 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also known as Adèle, she was married to Hugues Capet, and reigned jointly with him, and after his death 996 she also seems to have played a political role during the beginning of the reign of her son, Robert II. She was daughter o
2 CONC f Guillaume II and Adèle de Normandie, and lived (ca. 945-1004/06) [http://www.guide2womenleaders.com/womeninpower/Womeninpowe-chronological1.htm].
