2 CONT !"The Lives of the Kings & Queens of France"by Duc De Castries,1979,p.56. "Royal Ancestors" by Michel Call, 1989, chart # 11408 # 11412, # 11425, # 11699. "WesternEurope in the Middle Ages, 300-1475" by Tierney, 1978. (King 987-99
