2 CONT 8.        ''' MATHILDE''' (-[1005]).  Guillaume of Jumièges names “Emma...secunda Hadvis...tertia Mathildis” as the three daughters of Richard and his wife “Gunnor ex nobilissima Danorum prosapia ortam”, adding that Mathilde marri
2 CONC ed “Odoni comiti” by whom she was childless, a later passage stating that her dowry was “medietatem Dorcasini castri”[143].  m ([1003/04]) as his first wife, EUDES [II] Comte de Blois, son of EUDES [I] Comte de Blois & his wife Be
2 CONC rthe de Bourgogne [Welf] ([982/83]-15 Nov 1037). 
