2 CONC origny names "unus Godefridus alter…Willermus" as sons of "Ricardi primi ducis Normanniæ" by concubines[145].  He is named son of duke "Richard the elder" by Orderic Vitalis, who specifies that his father gave Brionne "with the wh
2 CONC ole county" to him[146].  Comte d'Eu after 996.    -        COMTES d'EU. 
