2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunnor de Crepon was the "Danish wife" of Richard I "Sans Peur", Leader of the Normans of Rouen, son of Guillaume "Longue-Épée", Princeps Nortmannorum and "Sprota," before 961. She married him (in a Christian wedding) after 968.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunnor died in 1031 at age 95 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunnor was our ancestor through two distinct descent lines--one through her son Robert and the other through her daughter Hawise, each of whom was independently our ancestor.
2 CONT
2 CONT See "My Lines"
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/p338.htm#i5196 )
2 CONT
2 CONT from Compiler: R. B. Stewart, Evans, GA
2 CONT
2 CONT ( http://homepages.rootsweb.ancestry.com/~cousin/html/index.htm )
