2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT She associated with Richard I "Sans Peur", comte de Rouen, before 961.  This common law marriage was solemnized after 968 when Gunnor married Richard in a Christian ceremony (thereby legitimizing their children).
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1031 at age 95 years.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT She associated with Richard I "Sans Peur", comte de Rouen, before 961.  This common law marriage was solemnized after 968 when Gunnor married Richard in a Christian ceremony (thereby legitimizing their children).
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1031 at age 95 years.
