1 NOTE Her parentage is unknown, earliest sources reporting solely that she was of Danish ancestry and naming siblings including brother Herefast de Crepon who is sometimes erroneously given as her father.
1 NOTE The Mammoth book of British Kings and Queens says that she was a daughterod Harald Bluetooth, King of Denmark. (Ron Custer)Ancestral FileNumber:<AFN> 9HMD-WL
1 NOTE BIOGRAPHY: Duchess of Normandy
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Some historians list her parents as Harold Graypelt Ericsson, King of 
2 CONT Norway and his wife Gunhilda
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Marriage 1 Hugh of COUSTANCES
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Marriage 2 Richard I the Fearless of NORMANDY b: 28 AUG 933 in Fecamp, Seine-Inferieure, Normandy, France
2 CONT Event: Partners AFT 962 in France
2 CONT Children
2 CONT  William de Hiesmes DE EU b: BET 972 AND 978
2 CONT  Hedwig (Havoise) DE NORMANDY b: BET 973 AND 977 in Bretagne, Normandy, France
2 CONT  Matilda (Mahaud) DE NORMANDY b: AFT 962
2 CONT  Beatrice of NORMANDY b: BET 980 AND 990
2 CONT  Richard II The Good of NORMANDY b: BET 958 AND 962 in Normandy, France
2 CONT  Emma of NORMANDY b: BET 982 AND 987 in Normandy, France
2 CONT  Robert D'EVEREUX b: ABT 964 in Normandy, France
2 CONT  Godfrey DE EU b: ABT 953 in Normandy, France
2 CONT  Mauger DE MORTAIN b: 967 in Normandy, France
