2 CONC and Normandy became one of the most thoroughly feudalized states on the continent. He carried out a major reorganization of the Norman military system, based on heavy cavalry. He also became guardian of the young Hugh, Count of Pa
2 CONC ris, on the elder Hugh's death in 956.
