2 CONT !RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT     1. Even though Richard I did not marry Gonnor until after 962 according to Norman law, he married her according to Danish custom prior to his betrothal to Emma, daughter of Hugh "The Great", Duke of France. Years after his bet
2 CONC rothal to Emma (who was only a child at the time), he married her in 960.
2 CONT !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. Tab. Souv. Gen., France 22, Tab. 48
