1 NOTE Louis IV of France took the boy-duke into his protective custody, apparently intent upon reuniting Normandy to the crown's domains; but in 945 Louis was captured by the Normans, and Richard was returned to his people. Richard with
2 CONC stood further Carolingian attempts to subdue his duchy and, in 987, was instrumental in securing the French crown for his brother-in-law, the Robertian Hugh Capet.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han ble også herre over Bretagne i 945, men måtte kjempe for sitt land mot Ludvig IV av Frankrike.
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard was married the first time with Emma, sister of Hugo Capet, but had no children.
