2 CONT Ebles de Turenne, died Abt. 1030. He was the son of 32. Archembaud of Comdorn and 33. Sulpice de Turenne. He married 17. Beatrix of Normandy 988.
2 CONT
2 CONT  17. Beatrix of Normandy, born Aft. 985. She was the daughter of 34. Richard of Normandy I and 35. Gunnora Haraldsdatter of Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Ebles de Turenne and Beatrix Normandy is:
2 CONT
2 CONT  8 i. William de Turenne, married Matilda ?.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebles was also called Graf von Roucy Ebalus I von Roucy German.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebles I, comte de Reims & de Roucy, married Beatrix de Hainaut, daughter of Régnier IV, comte de Hainaut and Adwige de France, before 1013. They were divorced after 1015.
