2 CONT Beatrix was also called Beatrix von Hennegau.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix married Ebles I, comte de Reims & de Roucy, son of Gilbert, comte de Reims & de Roucy and UNKNOWN de Poitiers, before 1013; they were divorced after 1015. Beatrix then married Manasses "the Bold" of Rheims after 1016.
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatrix died after 1035.
