2 CONC ivorce.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Beatrix of HAINAUT''' [Parents] 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 was born 999 in Mons, Hainaut, Belgium. She married Ebles I de ROUCY Count of Rheims on 1018 in Roucy, Aisne, France. The marriage ended in divorce.
