1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Gilette de Beaumont married Ansfrid the Dane, son of Hrolf Turstan and Gerlotte of Blois.1 Gilette de Beaumont was born circa 930.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maurice Boddy posits that she was the daughter of Bernard "the Dane" de Harcourt  and Sprote de Bourgogne. http://mauriceboddy.org.uk/MontfortSurRisle.htm  [He is probably wrong, because this causes a timey-wimey loop.]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sites.rootsmagic.com/EDC1/individual.php?p=81268 gives another possible genealogical link to the Father and Mother of Gilette.  
2 CONT
2 CONT This site claims that her Father was Comte Godfried (Ginbert) de Beaulac, birthdate as yet unknown, but he died circa 942 A.D. (CE) Her Mother was Mathilde de Luxemboug, biorn circa 907 A.D.(CE)
2 CONT
2 CONT Either way, Gilette only assumes the title "la Danois" after she married Ansfrid (Lancelot) son of Hrolf "Rollo" Turstan
