1 NOTE Alias:<ALIA> "The /Dane"/
2 CONT AKA Bernard "le Danois" Founding father of the Houseof Harcourt What 
2 CONT follows in the Harcourt line comes mainly from the book called " A 
2 CONT History of the Family Harcourt " written by William Harcourt-Bath in 1930 
2 CONT this book was found at the San Diego Public Library,main branch on "E" 
2 CONT Street along with the hand written notes of William Harcourt-Bath in the 
2 CONT Genealogy section on the second floor. I believe this is a one and only 
2 CONT book,theoriginal. I have a copy. Chief counsellor to Rollo in the 
2 CONT conquest of Normandy,France. His descendents followed " William the 
2 CONT Conqueror " into England. The 
2 CONT family is a direct descendent of " Charlemagne " and the Trojan Senator 
2 CONT Antenor The name seems to come from "Herr" ( A Teuteonic courtesy title), 
2 CONT meaning lord or gentleman and court meaning hall or mansion. 
2 CONT I.E."HerrCourt" . The name has evolved over the years, Herecourt , 
2 CONT Harecourt , Harcourt. Per Crispin and Macary,derived from G.A.La 
2 CONT Roque,Hist. Geneal Maison de Harcourt thename derives from the bourg of 
2 CONT Harcourt, near Brionne,France. Descendents include Sires de 
2 CONT Beaumont,comtes de Meulant,the barons of Cacelles and Saint-Pare,the 
2 CONT Lords of Gournay and Milly,the barons of Neubourg,the viacomtes of 
2 CONT Evereux and the Earls of Leicester.
