2 CONT Gautier I, comte de Vexin, Valois, et Amiens1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT b. circa 925, d. between 992 and 998
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Raoul de Gouy b. circa 905, d. 926
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Eldegarde d' Amiens b. circa 905, d. after 965
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gautier I, comte de Vexin, Valois, et Amiens was born circa 925. He was the son of Raoul de Gouy and Eldegarde d' Amiens. Gautier I, comte de Vexin, Valois, et Amiens married Adèle d'Anjou, daughter of Foulques I "le Roux", c
2 CONC omte d'Anjou and Roscille, dame de Loches, before 944. Gautier I, comte de Vexin, Valois, et Amiens died between 992 and 998.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Adèle d'Anjou b. circa 924
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT Gautier II "the White", comte de Vexin, Valois, et Amiens+ b. c 944, d. 10273
2 CONT
