1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Bernard (Bormard) Comte de Senlis''' was born 919 in Somme, Picardy, France, and died AFT 965 in Senlis, Oise, Picardy, France. He married . He was the son of Pepin II de Vermandois Comte de Senlis. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From jweber -- The Phillips, Weber, Kirk, & Staggs families of the Pacific Northwest < [https://wc.rootsweb.com/trees/162642/I00696/-/registry Rootsweb] >
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Bernard (Bormard) Comte de /Senlis/ are:
2 CONT # Adele de Senlis was born ABT 954 in Senlis, Oise, Picardy, France.
2 CONT # Robert I de Peronne was born ABT 965 in Senlis, Oise, Picardy, France, and died AFT 1034 in Peronne, Somme, Picardy, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
