1 NOTE AFN:9G82-6D
1 NOTE Adalbert I of Vermandois (French: Albert I le Pieux, the Pious) (ca. 915/917 - 9 September 988), Count of Vermandois, was the son of Herbert II of Vermandois and Adela.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT In 954 he married Gerberge of Lorraine (ca. 935-978), daughter of Giselbert, Duke of Lorraine, and Gerberga of Saxony.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were:
2 CONT Herbert III of Vermandois 
2 CONT Eudes of Vermandois (ca. 956-983) 
2 CONT Liudolfe de Noyon (ca. 957-986) 
2 CONT Guy I of Vermandois, count of Soissons 
