1 NOTE 221809080. Storfyrste Svetoslav I IGORSON av Kiev(13020) was born about 945.(13021) He was a Storfyrste between 964 and 972 in Kiev.(13022) He died 972 Drept.(13023) Drept av Petschengerne mot deres fyrste Kuria. Med sin tjenerinn
2 CONC e Matuscha hadde han sønnen Vladimir.
1 NOTE !BIRTH: "Royal Ancestors" by Michel Call - Based on Call Family Pedigrees FHL
