2 CONT It has been ''speculated'' that '''Constance''', wife to Boso II of Arles and grandmother of Queen Constance of Arles, was daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Charles-Constantine-Count-of-Vienne/6000000000347520217 Charles Co
