2 CONT from Wikipedia: Gerloc (or Geirlaug), baptised in Rouen as Adela (or Adèle) in 912, was the daughter of Rollo, first duke of Normandy, and his wife, Poppa. She was the sister of Duke William Longsword. In 935, she married William 
2 CONC Towhead, the future count of Poitou and duke of Aquitaine. They had two children together before she died on 14 October 962: William IV of Aquitaine and Adelaide of Aquitaine, who became the wife of Hugh Capet
