2 CONT 6b.   Hedwig of Saxony, mar Hugh Magnus, d. 16 June 956, Duke of Franks.  She was sister of Henry I, who succeeded his father as Duke of Bavaria.  She and Hugh Magnus were parents of Hugh Capet, first Capetian king.
