2 CONT Page 59:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.     William I Longsword, assassinated 17 Dec. 942 on the Island of Picquingy in the Somme; Duke of Normandy; steadfastly Christian; did homage to King Raoul 933 for Cotentin and Avranches, and after Raoul's death, came to terms
2 CONC  with King Louis IV of the restore Carolingian dynasty.  He mar. Adela, dau. of Hubert, Count of Senlis.
