1 NOTE 110897832. Hertug Wilhelm I. Langsverd ROLVSON av Normandie was born in 900. He was born about 912 in Rouen.(9488) He was a Hertug between 931 and 942 in Normandie (F). He died on 17 Dec 942 in Myrdet. (9489) He died on 17 Dec 942
2 CONC . (9490) Myrdet under en sammenkomst med grev Arnulf av Flandern, bisatt i katedralen i Rouen He was a Hertug in Normandie (F). (9491) He was married to Sprota N.NSDTR av Bratagne.
