2 CONC of Bellême', Transactions of the Royal Historical Society, Fourth Series, Vol. 22 (1940), p. 68 Thomas Stapleton, Magni Rotuli Scaccarii Normanniae sub Regibus Angliae, Tomis I (Sumptibus Soc. Antiq. Londinensis, Londini, 1840), p
2 CONC . lxxii Geoffrey H. White, 'The First House of Bellême', Transactions of the Royal Historical Society, Fourth Series, Vol. 22 (1940), p. 78 Geoffrey H. White, 'The First House of Bellême', Transactions of the Royal Historical Soci
2 CONC ety, Fourth Series, Vol. 22 (1940), p. 76 Geoffrey H. White, 'The First House of Bellême', Transactions of the Royal Historical Society, Fourth Series, Vol. 22 (1940), pp. 76–7 Jean Jacques Gautier, Histoire d'Alençon (Poulet-Mala
2 CONC ssis, Imprimeur-Libraire, Place Bourbon, 1805), p. 24 Ordericus Vitalis, The Ecclesiastical History of England and Normandy, Trans. Thomas Forester, Vol. I (Henry G. Bohn, London, 1853), p. 390 Thomas Stapleton, Magni Rotuli Scacc
2 CONC arii Normanniae sub Regibus Angliae, Tomis I (Sumptibus Soc. Antiq. Londinensis, Londini, 1840), pp. lxxi–ii Geoffrey H. White, 'The First House of Bellême', Transactions of the Royal Historical Society, Fourth Series, Vol. 22 (19
