2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Adelaide of Poitou b: ABT 945 in Poitiers, Vienne, Poitou, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Regnier IV Count of Hainault b: ABT 950 in Hainault, Belgium
2 CONT
