2 CONT 8c.    REGNIER IV, c. 950-1013, Count of Hainaut; mar. Edith (Hedwig), dau. of Hugh Capet, King of France and Adelaide of Poitou, thus mingling the Merovingian, Carolingian and Capetian lines.
2 CONT
