2 CONT
2 CONT When '''Emma de Torta''', comtesse de Varenne was born about 0960, in Bellencombre, Seine-Maritime, Upper Normandy, France, [her father, Rodolphe de Torta, was 27 and her mother, Herfast de Crepon Arque, was 22.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gautier de Warenne de Saint-Martin comte de Varenne about 0991, in France. They were the parents of at least 2 sons. She died on 4 November 1022, in Bellencombre, Seine-Maritime, Normandy, France, at the age of 63, and
2 CONC  was buried in France.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT N. N. de Torta was born circa 970. She married Guillaume de Varennes, son of Gautier de St. Martin, before 998.
