2 CONT HUGUES [I] de Gournay (-after 989).  Gauthier de la Ferté founded the priory of La Ferté en Brai, at the command of "fratre Hugone", by charter dated to [989/96], which names his father Renaud and his mother Alberade[912].  The "c
2 CONC ommand" of his brother suggests that Hugues was the older son, and presumably also Seigneur de Gournay.  
