2 CONT Foulques Fulk I Red de Anjou 39GGF 870–942 Birth 870 • Anjou, Isere, Rhone-Alpes, France Death 13 AUG 942 • Anjou, Isere, Rhone-Alpes, France
2 CONT
2 CONT When Foulques Fulk I Red de Anjou was born in 870 in Anjou, Isère, France, his father, Ingelger, was 25 and his mother, Adelaide, was 16. He married Roscilla Rosele Comtesse de Loches d'Anjou on July 5, 905, in Tours, Puy-de-Dôme,
2 CONC  France. They had two children during their marriage. He died on August 13, 942, in his hometown at the age of 72.
