2 CONT Sources: RC 109, 374: AF: Kraentzler 1450; and Pfafman.   Prince of Danes or Norsemen who invaded Normandy with Rollo.
2 CONT    Also called Foulques I.   RC: Vicomte of Angers and the first real Count of Anjou. He and Roscilla were PROBABLE parents of Adele.
