2 CONT Ermenfroi d'Amiens, Comte d'Amiens, de Valois et du Vexin
2 CONT
2 CONT ▼Facts and Events Name[1] Ermenfroi d'Amiens, Comte d'Amiens, de Valois et du Vexin  Death[1] bet 919 and 923  
2 CONT
2 CONT Very little is known about Ermenfroi, other than that he was Count of Amiens, Valois and Vexin in the early 10th century, that he died between 919 and 923, and that he had brothers Gozbert and Francon, abbot of Corbie. Seversmith 
2 CONC speculated that the wife of Raoul de Gouy was Ermenfroi's daughter or niece, and through her, Amiens, Valois and Vexin were passed to her son. 
2 CONT
