2 CONT Reginar, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT By his wife Hersinda (or Alberada), who predeceased him, Reginar left the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Reginar II, Count of Hainaut
2 CONT
