2 CONT
2 CONT Historical documents contain no information about her, as Old Rus’ chronicles rarely recorded women's names unless they played a direct role in state or dynastic events. Attempts to assign her a name appear solely in modern fictio
2 CONC n and lack scholarly substantiation.
