2 CONT    Sources: A. Roots 121E; RC 162, 166; Kraentzler 1160, 1443, 1453; Coe,AF and
2 CONT Pfafman; Davis; Norr, p59.
2 CONT    Roots: Poppa
2 CONT    Duchess of Norway. Also called Poppa de Valoise. Other names: Papia,Papa,
2 CONT Papie, Popa.
2 CONT    Davis: Popa, daugher of Frankis Count of Bayeux.
2 CONT    Norr: Poppa de Bayeuc [sic] (or de Valois), daughter of Count ofBayeau.
2 CONT 2nd wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT The vast majority of the information presented is obtained from online sources.  While I believe it to be accurate, caution must be taken to always be careful of its validity.
2 CONT Please do contact me if you find errors or have questions.
