2 CONT Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 123 says c870; members.aol.com/sargen3 says
2 CONT ABT 854, Maer; misc.traveller.com/genealogy/gedhtml/kmilburn say 845;
2 CONT SOUR Americans of Royal Descent, p. 25, 30;COMYN4.TAF,p6;ROYAL.THD say 932;
2 CONT COMYNI.GED (Compuserve) says ABT 933,NORM.TAF (Compuserve) (says 933);
2 CONT GWALTNEY.ANC 508044998 says d. 931;Royalty for Commoners p. 123 says 927-932
2 CONT SOUR www.gendex.com
2 CONT SOUR Americans of Royal Descent, Charles H. Browning
2 CONT Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 123
