2 CONT Dutch "Winkler Prins" encyclopedia says Henry was via his mother a
2 CONT grandson of Louis the German (who was a grandson of Charlemagne). The
2 CONT sources of this article are:
2 CONT - Jahrbücher des deutschen Reichs unter König Heinrich, by G. Waitz (1885,
2 CONT 1963)
2 CONT - König Heinrich I, by Fr. Lüdtke (1936)
2 CONT - Geschichte der sächsischen Kaiserzeit, by R. Holzmann (1941, 1953)
2 CONT - König Heinrich I, by W. Mohr (1950)
2 CONT - Von den Karolingern zu den Staufern, by J. Haller (1958)
2 CONT - Die Mark Brandenburg, by J. Schultze (1961)
2 CONT - Heinrich I, Südwest- und Westpolitik, by H. Büttner (1964)
2 CONT "Von den Karolingern zu den Staufern" is the source of the genealogicalinformation in the article.
