2 CONT
2 CONT From the English Wikipedia page on Béatrice of Vermandois:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/B%C3%A9atrice_of_Vermandois
2 CONT
2 CONT Béatrice of Vermandois (c. 880 – after March 26, 931) was the daughter of Herbert I, Count of Vermandois.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and issue
2 CONT
2 CONT She married in 895 Robert (d. 923), Marquis of Neustria, who became the King of France in 922. They had the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Emma, married around 918 to Rudolph, Duke of Burgundy, later King of France.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Hugh the Great, duke of the Franks, who was the father of Hugh Capet.
2 CONT
2 CONT References
2 CONT
2 CONT Patrick Van Kerrebrouck, Nouvelle histoire généalogique de l'auguste maison de France, vol. 1 : La Préhistoire des Capétiens (par Christian Settipani), 1993
2 CONT
2 CONT Queen of Western Francia 922–923 
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by Eadgifu of England 
2 CONT
2 CONT Succeeded by Emma of France (daughter)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.rpi.edu/~holmes/Hobbies/Genealogy/ps03/ps03_444.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT W.H.Turton, "The Plantagenet Ancestry" (Balt.:Gen.Pub.Co.,1968),p.112, gives Beatrix' mother as ______ "of France,"daughter of Robert the Strong, Count of Blois (ID1428). "Ancestral Roots..." (Balt., 1992) 53-18 gives her mother a
2 CONC s Bertha de Morvois. 
2 CONT
2 CONT References: [Weis1],[AR7]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Béatrice of Vermandois (c. 880 – after March 26, 931) was the wife of Robert I, King of France . She is sometimes stated to be the sister of Herbert II, Count of Vermandois. No contemporary source explicitly states that Heribert I
2 CONC I and Beatrix were the children of Herbert I, and researchers are divided on the probability of this relationship. 
2 CONT Marriage and issue:  She married in 895 Robert (d. 923), Marquis of Neustria, who became the King of France in 922. They had the following:
2 CONT  Richilda of France
2 CONT  Hugh the Great, duke of the Franks, who was the father of Hugh Capet.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Béatrice_of_Vermandois
