1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''ROBERT I ([860]-killed in battle near Soissons 15 Jun 923)  King of France in 922.  '''
2 CONT s/o ROBERT "le Fort" ([815/30]-killed in battle Brissarthe 2 Jul 866) & NN
2 CONT x NN
2 CONT *[ADELA] (<898-) x (<21 May 907) HERIBERT [II] Comte de Vermandois 
2 CONT xx  ([897] ) BEATRIX de Vermandois, d/o HERIBERT [I] Comte de Vermandois ([880/83]-> 26 Mar 931)
