2 CONT Birth*	Robert I Capet De Morvais, King of West Franks, Marquis De Neustra was born in 866 in Bourgogne, France. 
2 CONT
2 CONT 	He was the son of Robert (Rupert Iv) Capet "The Strong", Marquis De Neustra and Adelaide De Tours, De Aquitane. 
2 CONT
