2 CONT
2 CONT Alaïdis Amiens 1 's (870-910) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She is the daughter of Eghard Amiens. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in 870 1 She married Raoul, Count of Cambrai, son of Baldwin I, Count of Flanders and Judith of France in 893 1 She died in 910 1. 
2 CONT
2 CONT List of known children: + 1 Berthe de Cambrai (895-967) (Raoul, Count of Cambrai) + 2 Aleïdis Cambrai (895-940) (Raoul, Count of Cambrai) 
