2 CONC  — married [date unknown] [location unknown] Mother of Unknown (Giffard) Comyn, Osborne Giffard II, Geoffrey Giffard, Unknown (Bolbec) Rouen, Walter Giffard, Berenger Griffard and Elias I Giffard	 Died December 8, 1040 in , , Fran
