1 NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> 8XJV-3XOsborne de Bolebec, a noble Norman,living temp. Richard sans peur Duc de Normandie, m. Avelina, sister ofGunnora, Duchess of Normandie, and had two sons, Walter and Osborn, [SirBernard Burke, Dor
2 CONC mant, Abeyant, Forfeited and Extinct Peerages, Burke'sPeerage, Ltd., London, England, 1883, p. 230, Giffard, Earls ofBuckingham]
