2 CONT
2 CONT 1.    Osborne de Bolebec, Lord of Longueville-la-gifart, Normandy, 1028-35; mar. prob. 1000 Avelina, sister of Gunnora,  William the Conqueror's Great-grandmother.  They had Walter, Count of Longueville-la-Gifart, and 2b. (below) 
2 CONC Osborne (Osbert), the Conqueror's first cousins twice removed.
