2 CONT
2 CONT RENAUD .  Seigneur de Gournay.  m ALBERADE, daughter of ---.  Gauthier de la Ferté founded the priory of La Ferté en Brai, at the command of "fratre Hugone", by charter dated to [989/96], which names his father Renaud and his moth
2 CONC er Alberade[911].  Renaud & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         HUGUES [I] de Gournay (-after 989).  Gauthier de la Ferté founded the priory of La Ferté en Brai, at the command of "fratre Hugone", by charter dated to [989/96], which names his father Renaud and his mother Alberade[91
2 CONC 2].  The "command" of his brother suggests that Hugues was the older son, and presumably also Seigneur de Gournay. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         GAUTHIER de la Ferté (-after 989).  Gauthier de la Ferté founded the priory of La Ferté en Brai, at the command of "fratre Hugone", by charter dated to [989/96], which names his father Renaud and his mother Alberade[913
2 CONC ].  
2 CONT --------------------
