1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Gisele Chevreuse
2 CONT * born 0980 in Beaumont, Normandie, France [uncertain]
2 CONT * Died 1039 at about age 59 in France
2 CONT * daughter of Guy I de Chevreuse (950-980)
2 CONT * wife of Yves Beaumont (975-1022), son of Yves Ham, de Beaumont 
2 CONT * mother of wife of Dreux de Mello 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Chevreuse-1
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT No reliable documentation has been found for this person, who appears in numerous popular genealogies.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Name and Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT Gisele de Chevreuse was born about 980 [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gisele de Chevreuse appears on one popular genealogy [2] with a birth year of 978.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Location
2 CONT
2 CONT She is presently shown as born in Beaumont, Normandy. This, however, may reflect her marriage to Ivo de Beaumont, which appears to be disproved.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth location: there are several places called Beaumont in Normandy: Beaumont-en-Auge, Beaumont-Hague, Beaumont-le-Hareng, Beaumont-le-Richard, and Beaumont-le-Roger. This profile however showed "Beaumont-sur-Oise, Normandie" as 
2 CONC birth place. Beaumont-sur-Oise is not in Normandy and never was. At any rate, the precise birth place of someone born at this period is unlikely to be known. Beaumont here probably refers to a fief.
2 CONT
2 CONT Since she is "of Chevreuse", a more likely place of birth might be Wikipedia: Chevreuse itself, which like Beaumont-sur-Oise is near Paris.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT
2 CONT She is shown as the daughter of Guy I de Chevreuse (950-980) [2] about whom nothing else is shown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT She is shown as the wife of Ivo II (Yves) The Ancient" de Beaumont-sur-l'Oise, Seigneur of Beaumont sur l'Oise. [2][3].
2 CONT
2 CONT This Ivo, however, is Ivo de Beaumont, who is well documented by Charles Cawley [4], but whose is married to Emma and not to Gisele. '''Her link to this marriage has therefore been removed.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT She is shown as the mother of Ivo III de Beaumont and also Ermengarde de Beaumont. [2]. Ermengarde may be the daughter she is currently shown with. Since she is not the wife of Ivo II, she is not the mother of Ivo III, and therefo
2 CONC re she has been disconnected from that relationship.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disambiguation: Early Ivo's and Wives
2 CONT
2 CONT There are several early Ivos on WikiTree who can be confused.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ivo born ca 990 Beaumont sur l'OilesRoches, France, died 22 May 1059. Married Emma, son Ivo. Documented with FMG. De-linked from wife Giselle
2 CONT * Giselle de Chevreuse, born 980, delinked from [[Bellomontenis-1|Ivo Bellomontensis but still linked as wife to Beaumont-281.
2 CONT * Yves Beaumont LInked to Giselle as husband. He appears to be part of a line of descent, all members of which are unsourced.
2 CONT * Ivo II, born ca 1026, son of [[Bellomontenis-1|Ivo I]. This Ivo had been conflated with persons located in Cotentin, but no basis in fact has appeared to justify that.
2 CONT * Ivo born 1005. No reliable evidence has been found of his existence. Allegedly son of Neel de St Sauveur and [[Brionne-23|Adele de Brionne. Married Emme de Bretagne and Gisele de Beaumont. Parents of Nine
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT The following line of descent is probably from the same source, which at present has not been found. An estimated birth year has been added based on the 30 year principle. Actual dates may be different when found.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Fouchard of Ham, born 920
2 CONT * Yves of Ham born 945
2 CONT * Yves Beaumont born 975
2 CONT * Unknown Beaumont daughter, born 1000, married Dreux De Mello,
2 CONT * Gilbert de Mello, born 1020.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogiequebec.info/testphp/info.php?no=114220
