1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==concerns==
2 CONT '''Stirnet's "Viking01" page (link below) reports this Turstan as a son of https://www.geni.com/people/Eystein-Ivarsson-the-Noisy-Glumra/6000000000701119941 and https://www.geni.com/people/%C3%81sd%C3%ADs-Ragnvaldsd%C3%B3ttir/6000
2 CONC 000001200597069, which conflicts with the "NORMANDY NOBILITY: ARQUES, AUMÂLE, CAUX, ROUEN, EU" page in ''Medieval Lands'' (link below) and the curator note above.
2 CONT
