2 CONT
2 CONT GIROIE [Geroius], son of ARNAUD "le Gros" & his wife --- (-1050 or after). ....
2 CONT
2 CONT m GISLA, daughter of THURSTAN de Bastembourg & his wife ---.  Guillaume de Jumièges records the marriage of Giroie and Gisela daughter of "Toustain de Montfort" and names their seven sons and four daughters, in order, "Ernauld, Fo
2 CONC ulques qui périt avec le comte Gilbert, Guillaume, Raoul Male-Couronne, Robert, Hugues et Giroie et les filles Heremburge, Emma, Adelaide et Hadvise"[190].  Orderic Vitalis names her and her father, as well as her seven sons and f
2 CONC our daughters[191]. 
2 CONT
