2 CONT Garnier Seigneur de Loches 40GGF 844–928 Birth 844 • Loches, Indre-et-Loire, Centre, France Death 928 • Verberie Sur, Oise, Picardie, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Garnier Seigneur de Loches was born in 844 in Loches, Indre-et-Loire, France. He married Petronella Toscanda and they had one daughter together. He then married Teutberga de Arles in Arles, Pyrénées-Orientales, France. He died in 
2 CONC 928 in Verberie, Oise, France, having lived a long life of 84 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
