2 CONT Petronella Toscanda was born in 845 in Loches, Indre-et-Loire, France. She married Garnier Seigneur de Loches in France. They had one child during their marriage. She died having lived for more than 100 years. She died in 948 in h
2 CONC er hometown at the age of 103.
