2 CONC  was Holy Roman Emperor Charlemagne), he was born in Anjou and Christened at St Martin Detours. His son Fulk became the first count of Anjou. After Robert the Strong, he directed the resistance to the Norman invasions on the Loire
2 CONC . Ingeleger eventually died at the age of 43 in Tours.
