2 CONT Marriage and children [ edit ] Reinier married in 885 with Alberada (854 - after 919). Her origin is unknown, but her age before marriage indicates that she was a (wealthy?) Widow. From Reinier and Alberada the following children 
2 CONC are known: [7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Giselbert II of Maasgouw (approx. 890 - Andernach , 2 October 939), Duke of Lorraine A daughter, married to Berengar Count in the Lommegouw, the later names († after 938) Reinier II of Hainaut (approx. 890 - 932, or later), Count 
2 CONC of Hainaut Shortly after the death of Reinier in 915, Alberada married Waldger , son of Gerulf I [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ....................................................................................................................................................................... Her parents are not named in contemporary sources, and are gen
2 CONC erally considered to be unknown. She was perhaps the heir of Hainault, the castle of Mons having been its central fortress.
