2 CONT From the English Wikipedia page for Herbert I, Count of Vermandois: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herbert_I,_Count_of_Vermandois
2 CONT
2 CONT Herbert I of Vermandois (c. 848/850 – 907), Count of Vermandois, lord of Senlis, of Péronne and of Saint Quentin, was the son of Pepin of Vermandois.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and issue
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Bertha de Morvois.[2] They had the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT *1. Herbert II of Vermandois[3] (c. 880-943)
2 CONT *2. Béatrice of Vermandois (c. 880-931), married King Robert I of France.
2 CONT *3.Cunigunde of Vermandois (d. 943)
2 CONT *4. Adele of Vermandois
2 CONT
