2 CONT
2 CONT Based on genealogy from Works of Empress Catherine II (Сочинения императрицы Екатерины II), Book 8, pages 28-41:  "...Rurik's father was Finlandia's King, and his mother was Umila, daughter of Gostomysl. Rurik I was Grand Prince (
2 CONC Velikiy Knyaz) of Northern Russia 862-879. His wife was Efanda (Yefanda), Norwegian Princess (Kniazhna Urmanskaya). From this union was born: Igor I, Grand Prince (Velikiy Knyaz) of Northern and Southern Russia 879-945. His wife w
2 CONC as Olga, [Igor I was] great-grandchild of Gostomysl and grandchild of eldest of his daughter.  From this union Svyatoslav was born..."
2 CONT
