2 CONC ames "Ebolus…Abba" as nepos of "Gauzlinus…pontificis"[279], the latter being reported in other sources as the son of Rorico [I] Comte du Maine.  It is possible that the wife of Comte Rainulf was Comte Rorico's daughter named [Bili
