2 CONT
2 CONT Widukind names "Thiadrici" as father of Queen Mathilde, specifying that the family was "stirpis magni ducis Widukindi"[31].  The father of Queen Mathilde is named "Thietricus" in the Vita Mathildis Reginæ[32].  
