2 CONT From the Wikipedia page on Hedwiga: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hedwiga
2 CONT
2 CONT Hedwiga (also known as Hathui) was the daughter of Henry of Franconia and his wife Ingeltrude. She married Otto I, Duke of Saxony. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three sons, Henry (who succeeded his father as Duke of Saxony), Thankmar and Liudolf (who both died young), as well as a daughter, Oda. Oda married Zwentibold, King of Lotharingia.
2 CONT
