2 CONC unt of Aargau
2 CONT
2 CONT     and Auxerre, d. 863, daughter of Hugh, Count of Tours, by his wife Bava. He had by (2) wife: (1) Odo or Eudes, King of the Franks (France), and (2) Robert I, Count of Paris 888, King of the Franks 922-3, father of Hugh Magnus.
2 CONC  [Ancestral Roots]
