1 NOTE <table width=610><tr align=left valign=top>
2 CONT <td colspan=3>
2 CONT Robert the Strong  (died 866), count of Anjou and Blois; at first rebelled against Charles the Bald but laterwon king's confidence by defense of the Seine and Loire valleys against the Normans and Bretons; his two sons, Odo andRob
2 CONC ert I, became kings of France.
2 CONT </td>
