2 CONT Princess of the Franks, Countess of Flanders
1 NOTE Unlike previous spouses of Wessex kings, Judith was crowned queen-cons ort when she was married to King Ethelwulf. This elevated her to Ethelw ulf's equal, which disgruntled many Saxons and caused problems several y ears later.
