2 CONC liis meis''", by charter dated 5 Feb 978, signed by "…''Emma comitissa Pictavæ urbis''…"[36].  
2 CONT >>“''Ledgardis comitissa necnon Hugo episcopus et filius meus et item filius meus Odo comes''” donated property to Saint-Martin de Tours, for the souls of “T''heobaldi comitis quondam senioris mei…Richildis quondam sanctimonialis,
