2 CONT '''Marriage Information:''' Luitgarde married Thibaut "le Tricheur", Comte de BLOIS, Vicomte de Tours, son of Thibault, Vicomte de TROYES and unknown 1st wife. (Thibaut "le Tricheur", Comte de BLOIS, Vicomte de Tours was born in 9
2 CONC 10 in Blois, France and died on 16 Jan 975-976.)
