2 CONT Sources: A. Roots 49 121E, 136; RC 133, 166, 231, 340; A. Roots 49,136; AF; Davis; Kraentzler 1152, 1160, 1217; Smallwood.
2 CONT Roots: Luitgarde de Vermandois, died after 978, widow of William I of Normandy and daughter of Herbert II de Vermandois.
2 CONT Roots 121E (new line): Luitgarde de Vermandois, n.i., killed 942 byLouis, son of Charles III, "the Simple."
2 CONT AF says she was Ledgarde, a duchess, who died 9 Feb. 978. K. alsocalls her Ledgarde.
2 CONT First marriage was to William I (Longespee/Longsword), Duke ofNormandy, and second to Thibaud. She would have been about 40 years younger thanWilliam.
2 CONT Davis: Gerloc, daughter of Herbert II, Count of Vermandois andChampagne.
2 CONT
