2 CONC (Capet, of Neustria)-14643 (MRIN:8465). Luitgarde was born before 925 in Vermandois, Aisne, Picardy, France. She died after 985 in Matemoutier Abbey, Vermandois, Normandie, France and was buried in Abbaye de Saint-Père, Chartres, 
2 CONC Eure-et-Loir, Centre, France.
