1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Medlands does not show an Adelaide as a daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Richard-II-duke-of-Burgundy/6000000002197813080?through=6000000012446146205 & his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Adelaide-of-Burgund
