2 CONT  # https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eberhard_III_van_de_Nordgau Erberhard was a descendant of Duke Eticho I of Alsace . Several lineages have been reconstructed but none are entirely convincing. Eberhard was married to Adelinda. He r
2 CONC epudiated her in order to take a nun from Erstein as his wife. Eberard and Adelinda had a son: Hugo (c. 875 - 940) who succeeded his father in his counties and was also count of Eguisheim and Hohenberg, and guardian of Lüders. Hug
2 CONC o was married to Hildegard of Ferrette (died before 940). After Hildegard's death Hugo gave up his functions and entered a monastery as a monk.
