2 CONT Ermengarde,is the Daughter of Emperor Lothar I and Ermengarde de Tours
2 CONT  Wife of Giselbert count of Lorraine, II and Giselbert von der Darnau, Comte d'Aquitaine et Brabant she was Duchesse de Moselle she was kidnapped 846
