2 CONT Misc. Notes
2 CONT *Americans of Royal Descent* by Charles Browning, 7th edition, 1986. has, p. 2 (and elsewhere, with minor differences): " PEPIN DE SENLIS DE VALOIS, Count Berengarius, of Bretagne, father of: LADY POPPA DE VALOIS, who m. (his firs
2 CONC t wife) Rollo the Dane." [If the above is true, then Pepin was the father of POPPE OF BAYEUX and was the same person as BERENGER, COUNT OF BAYEUX.] 
2 CONT *From K.Werner's Die Nachkommen der Karl der Grosse, in volume IV, Karl der Grosee, ed W.Braunfels, 1965: Count in 877, he was present at Reims in 893 with [his brother] HERIBERT when CHARLES THE SIMPLE was crowned by Abp Fulk. [e
2 CONC d. comment by the poster of this information: Sometimes secondary sources call him Ct of Valois, I don't know why.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT References: [WallopFH],[RoyalAAF],[RFC]
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses: (blank)
2 CONT
