2 CONT
2 CONT He is the son of Pépin II, comte de Péronne 2, 3 and Rothaïde de Bobbio 2, 3.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is maybe the son of Judicaël, comte de Rennes. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He is born circa 847 in Bayeux, 14, Normandie, France 3, 6. He marries Adalind de Bretagne 2. He marries Dame Gerberge de Rennes daughter of Gurvant de Rennes, duc de Bretagne and de Bretagne circa 875 4. Pépin III Bérenger de Sen
2 CONC lis, comte de Bayeux et Valois est cité in 889 1. He dies in 931 3, 4, 7. 
2 CONT
