2 CONT Name: Pepin I de Senlis
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: abt 842, Vermandois, Normandy, France Death: aft 28 Jan 893 Father: Count Pepin de Vermandois (817-892) Mother: Rothaide Misc. Notes
