2 CONC nd his parents "patre Geraldo Auriliaci comite…matre Adaltrude" when recording the birth of "Geraldum" in 855[307].  Comte [d´Aurillac].  Gérard is shown in Europäische Stammtafeln[308] as the son of Comte Gérard but the primary s
2 CONC ource on which this is based has not yet been identified.  “Gerardus comes” exchanged “æcclesia...Rovariam...in pago Lemovicino in vicaria Flaviniacense” for “villam...in pago Biturico in vicaria Nirondense...Coiacus” with Stodilu
2 CONC s Bishop of Limoges by charter dated 28 Jul 855[309].]  m ADALTRUDE, daughter of ---.  The Vita Sancti Geraldi Compendium names "Mathildem filiam Pippini Aquitaniæ regis…Geraldi aviam" and his parents "patre Geraldo Auriliaci comi
2 CONC te…matre Adaltrude" when recording the birth of "Geraldum" in 855[310].  
