2 CONC in * Carloman, son of Charles the Bald (849–876) * Rotrud (852–912), a nun * Ermentrud (854–877), a nun * Hildegard (born 856, died ?) * Gisela (857–874) Ermentrude had a gift for embroidery and an interest in religious foundation
