2 CONT >2.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Louis-II-the-Stammerer-king-of-the-West-Franks/2430192?through=6000000005588616059 LOUIS] (1 Nov 846-Compiègne 10 Apr 879, bur Compiègne, église collégiale Saint-Corneille).  The Genealogic
2 CONC a Arnulfi Comitis names (in order) "Hludovicum Karolum Karlomannum et Hlotharium" as the four sons of "Karolus imperator…ex Hyrmentrudi regina"[257].  He succeeded his father in 877 as LOUIS II "le Bègue" King of the West Franks. 
