2 CONT >7.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Ermengarda/6000000022864071316?through=6000000005588616059 ERMENTRUDIS] (-after 11 Jul 877).  The Genealogica Arnulfi Comitis names (in order) "Iudith et Hildegardim, Hirmintrudim et Gislam
2 CONC " as the four daughters of "Karolus imperator…ex Hyrmentrudi regina"[272].  The Historia Monasterii Hasnonensis names "Ermentrudis imperatrix et regina cum filia Ermendtrude"[273].  Abbess of Hasnon near Douai 11 Jul 877. 
