2 CONT Ben M. Angel's summary:
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:
2 CONT *Father: Louis/Hludowic I, Emperor of the Romans (778 - 20 June 840)
2 CONT *Mother: Judith von Bayern, Empress of the Romans (c805 - 19 April 843)
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings:
2 CONT *1. Gisela (819/822 - 1 July 874), wife of Eberhard, Marchese di Friulia.
2 CONT *3. Unknown Sister, wife to an Udalrichinger.
2 CONT
2 CONT Legitimate Half Siblings:
2 CONT *1. Lothaire/Lothar (795 - 29 September 855), Emperor of the Romans, King of Lotharingia
2 CONT *2. Pepin I (c797 - 13 December 838), King of Aquitaine
2 CONT *3. Hrotrud/Rotrude (b. c800)
2 CONT *4. Berta
2 CONT *5. Hildegard (802/804 - 857/860), Abbess of Notre-Dame and St-Jean at Laon
2 CONT *6. Louis (c806 - 28 August 876) "le Germanique/der Deutsche", King of the Eastern Franks.
2 CONT
2 CONT Illegitimate Half-Siblings:
2 CONT
2 CONT *1. Alpais (793/794 - 23 July 852), wife of Bego, Comte de Paris, and Abbess of St-Pierre-le-Bas at Reims.
2 CONT *2. Arnoul (c794 - after April 841), Comte de Sens (817 - 841)
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses and Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife 1: Ermentrudis (27 September 830 - 6 October 869)
2 CONT *1. Judith (c844 - after 870), wife of Aethelwulf, King of Wessex, and Aethelwulf's son, Aethelbald, King of Wessex, and Baudouin, Comte de Flandres.
2 CONT *2. Louis II (1 November 846 - 10 April 879) "le Begue", King of the West Franks.
2 CONT *3. Charles (847/848 - 29 September 866), King of Aquitaine (October 855 - 866), husband of the widow of Humbert, Comte de Bourges.
2 CONT *4. Carloman (d. 877/878), Abbot de St-Medard at Soisons, Abbot of Echternach in Luxembourg.
2 CONT *5. Lothaire (d. 14 December 865), Abbot of St-Germain at Auxerre.
2 CONT *6. Hildegardis
2 CONT *7. Ermentrudis (d. after 11 July 877), Abbess of Hasnon, near Douai (present France)
2 CONT *8. Gisela
2 CONT *9. Rotrudis (b. c850), Abbess of St-Radegonde at Poitiers (868 - 870)
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife 2: Richildis (d. after 30 January 910)
2 CONT *1. Rothildis (c871 - 22 March 929), wife of Roger, Comte du Maine, and Abbess of Chelles
2 CONT *2. Drogo (872/873 - 873/874) twin.
2 CONT *3. Pepin (872/873 - 873/874) twin.
2 CONT *4. Unknown son (23 March 875 - died young after baptism)
