2 CONT Basic information and justifications: pretty much everything taken from either FMG, or where lacking there, Wikipedia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 13 June 823 at Frankfurt-am-Main, Austrasia, Frankish Empire
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT * With Ermentrudis: 13 December 842 - Quierzy-sur-Oise, (Present Departement d'Aisne), Neustria, Frankish Empire. Separated 867, retiring to a Monastery St-Dionysus
2 CONT * With Richildis: marriage 12 October 869, confirmed at Aix-la-Chapelle, Ostenfrankenreich, 22 January 870  
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 6 October 877 - Avrieux or Brides-les-Bains, Regno Longobardo (Present Region Savoie, France), Western Francia
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: église de l'abbaye royale de Saint-Denis, Present Paris
2 CONT
2 CONT Occupation:
2 CONT *August 829 - March 830: Dux in Alemania, Rhetia, Alsace and part of Burgundy 
2 CONT *September 832 - 15 March 834: King of Aquitaine (first reign)
2 CONT *837 - 838: Ruler of lands between Frisia and the Seine.
2 CONT *838 - 28 May 839: Ruler of Maine and the lands between the Seine and the Loire.
2 CONT *28 May 839 - 20 June 840: Ruler of Western Francia
2 CONT *20 June 840 - 11 August 843: King of the Franks of the West
2 CONT *11 August 843 - 6 October 877: King of the West Franks
2 CONT * 848 - 6 October 877: King of Aquitaine (second reign)
2 CONT *8 August 869 - 6 October 877: King of Lotharingia 25 December 875 - 6 October 877: Emperor of the Romans 876 - 6 October 877: King of Italy 
