2 CONT Thibaut of TOURS Viscount of Tours 1, 2 was born 885 in Tours, Indre-et-Loire, France. He died 942 in Tours, Indre-et-Loire, France. Thibaut married Richilde de MAINE on 911 in Tours, Indre-et-Loire, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT Richilde de MAINE [Parents] 1, 2 was born 893 in , Maine, France. She married Thibaut of TOURS Viscount of Tours on 911 in Tours, Indre-et-Loire, France.
