0 @N6000000004270563089@ NOTE http://masseyfamgenealogy.tripod.com/a31.htm#i2327
1 CONT
1 CONT 1073741829. Adeline De Meulan Cts De Meulan [Countess Of Meulan] , daughter of Waleran Ct De Meulan [Count Meulent] and Oda De Conteville, was born in 1014 of Pontaudemer, Normandy, France and died on 8 Apr 1081, at age 67.
1 CONT
1 CONT     General Notes: ADELINE DE MEULLANT, daughter and eventually sole heiress of Waleran, Comte de Meullant, a great feudal nobleman of France. She died in 1081.
1 CONT     --- J Gardner Bartlett, *Newberry Genealogy*, Boston, 1914, p 5
1 CONT     Alt Birth: 1038 Meulan, Normandy, France
1 CONT
1 CONT         Noted events in her life were:
1 CONT
1 CONT         1. Fact 1: Eventually Sole Heiress Of Her Father.
1 CONT
1 CONT         2. Fact 2: Buried At Abbey Du Bec, France. 
1 CONT
1 CONT     Adeline married Roger De Beaumont Earl Of Meulan [Count Of Beaumont] in 1040 in Ponteaudemer, Normandy. 
1 CONT
1 CONT     Adeline next married William De Mauduit. 
