0 @N6000000002187734723@ NOTE William de Warenne, 2nd Earl of Surrey
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT William de Warenne, 2nd Earl of Surrey (d. 1138), was the son of William de Warenne, 1st Earl of Surrey and his first wife Gundrada. He is more often referred to as Earl Warenne or Earl of Warenne than as Earl of Surrey.
