1 CONT William de Warenne, 3rd Earl of Surrey is the son of William I de Warenne <p448.htm> and Gundreda (?) <p448.htm>. He was born circa 1119. He married Elizabeth de Vermandois <p10466.htm>, daughter of Hugh de Crépi, Comte de Vermand
1 CONC ois et de Valois <p10318.htm> and Aelis de Vermandois, Comtesse de Vermandois <p11359.htm>, after 5 June 1118. He died on 19 January 1148. He died on 11 August 1138.  He gained the title of 2nd Earl of Surrey. He gained the title 
1 CONC of 3rd Earl of Surrey.1 He gained the title of Earl of Warren.
