0 @N6000000004270563099@ NOTE http://masseyfamgenealogy.tripod.com/a32.htm#i2345
1 CONT
1 CONT 2147483658. Waleran Ct De Meulan [Count Meulent] , son of Count Of Meulan Hugh and Alix De Vexin, was born in 990 of Mellent, Normandy , France and died on 8 Oct 1069 in 1070, at age 79.
1 CONT
1 CONT     General Notes: Alt Name: Waleran II (Beaumont) De Meulan [Count Meulent]
1 CONT
1 CONT         Noted events in his life were:
1 CONT
1 CONT         1. Fact 1: Great Feudal Nobleman Of France. 
1 CONT
1 CONT     Waleran married Oda De Conteville about 1017 in France. 
1 CONT
1 CONT         Children from this marriage were:
1 CONT
1 CONT         1073741829       i.  Adeline De Meulan Cts De Meulan [Countess Of Meulan] (born in 1014 Of Pontaudemer, Normandy, France - died on 8 Apr 1081)
1 CONT                        ii.  Henri (Hugh) De Meulan Ct De Meulan (born in 1018 Of Meulan, Isle DE France, France)
0 @N6000000005076818600@ NOTE Waleran III de Meulan, Comte de Meulan gained the title of Comte de Meulan.
1 CONT Child of Waleran III de Meulan, Comte de Meulan
1 CONT Adeline de Meulan+ d. c 8 Apr 1081
