0 @N6000000002187734836@ NOTE Herbert IV of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert IV of Vermandois (1028 – 1080), Count of Vermandois. He was son of Otto of Vermandois and Pavia (or Patia).
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Family and children
1 CONT He was married Adele of Valois, daughter of Raoul III of Valois and Adele de Bar-sur-Aube. Their only child was Adele of Vermandois, married to Hugh of Vermandois.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Otto Count of Vermandois
1 CONT 1045–1080 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Eudes I l'Insensé 
