0 @N6000000000604974052@ NOTE Anne of Kiev, Princess of Kiev was the daughter of Jarislaus I of Kiev, Grand Duke of Kiev <p449.htm>. She was born circa 1024. She married Henri I, Roi de France <p10310.htm>, son of Robert II, Roi de France <p10310.htm> and Cons
1 CONC tance d'Arles <p10310.htm>, in 1051. She was also reported to have been married on 29 January 1044. She died circa 1075.  She gained the title of Princess Anne of Kiev.
