0 @N6000000003635697885@ NOTE [2469] http://library.monterey.edu/merrill/family/dorsett6/d0113/I11959.html Stuart p. 76
0 @N6000000004533071914@ NOTE THE ANCESTORS OF SIMON DE MONTFORT EARL OF LEICESTER (I)
1 CONT
1 CONT Amauri de Montfort attested charters of Robert I of France in 1022,1028, and 4 Feb 1031.  He is said to have been son of a William ofHainault, who is not otherwise known.  He appears to have begun thebuilding of Montfort, describe
1 CONC d as a "castrum" which was completed byhis son Simon. He is said to have m. Bertrade.  The date of his deathis unknown.  He left two sons, Simon, his successor, and Mainer; andprobably a daughter Eve who m. William Crispin.  [Comp
1 CONC lete PeerageVII:Appendix D:708]
1 CONT
1 CONT Note: Leo van de Plas, citing "Les seize quartiers des Reines etImperatrices Francaises", 1977, Jacques Saillot, takes the ancestrytwo more generations back at Montfort (not Hainault).
