0 @N6000000004533031110@ NOTE The following is excerpted (full post is in notes under father) froma post to SGM, 3 Dec 1996, by Todd Farmerie:
1 CONT
1 CONT From: Todd A. Farmerie (taf2@po.cwru.edu)
1 CONT Subject: Robert de Torigny and the family of Gunnor, Duchess ofNormandy
1 CONT Newsgroups: soc.genealogy.medieval
1 CONT Date: 1996/12/03
1 CONT
1 CONT Duvelina, a second sister of Gunnor, married Turulf de Pont Audemer,son of a Norman founder Torf, and uncle of the first of the Harcourts.They had at least one son, Humphrey de Vielles, who in turn was fatherof Roger de Beaumont, 
1 CONC another Conquest-era baron.
