0 @N6000000002187734871@ NOTE Otto, Count of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Otto of Vermandois (979 – 25 May 1045), Count of Vermandois, was the son of Herbert III of Vermandois and Ermengarde of Bar-sur-Seine.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Family and children
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Pavia (or Patia) (b. 990). Their children were:
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Herbert IV of Vermandois.
1 CONT    2. Eudes I the Insane, Count de Ham.
1 CONT    3. Peter of Vermandois.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Herbert III Count of Vermandois
1 CONT 1015–1045 Succeeded by
1 CONT Herbert IV
