0 @N6000000003615534150@ NOTE  Believed to have married Bertha of Burgundy (962-1010), widow ofCount Eudes I of Chartes. If so, be probably married her after 1003and married Constance of Toulouse about 1010. In this case, thechildren of Robert II are not assoc
1 CONC iated with the proper mother. Moreresearch is needed here.
