0 @N6000000002187734902@ NOTE Herbert III of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert III of Vermandois (953 – 1015), Count of Vermandois. He was son of Adalbert I of Vermandois and Gerberge of Lorraine.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Family and children
1 CONT He was married Ermengarde of Bar-sur-Seine (946 – after 1035). Their only son was Otto of Vermandois.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Adalbert I Count of Vermandois
1 CONT 987–1015 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Otto 
