1 CONT magnates was not a revolutionary action, but Hugh's crown was probably
1 CONT preserved by the inability of his enemies to coordinate their activities
1 CONT against him. He assured the succession of the crown to his son, Robert II by
1 CONT having him crowned on Christmas day, 987.
