1 CONT Roots: Richard I, "the Fearless,"b. Fecamp, ca. 933; named father's heir
1 CONT 29 May 942. Married first (Danish wife) Gunnor but betrothed ca. 945 and
1 CONT eventually married 960 to Emma. After Emma's death he married (Christian
1 CONT marriage) Gunnor to legitimize their children.
1 CONT Sureties: Richard I, the Fearless, Duke of Normandy.
