0 @N6000000002322325498@ NOTE In the history of the Dukes of Normandy, there is no information between 931
1 CONT and 942 as to the Dukes of Normandy. The 1st duke was Rollo, a direct
1 CONT ancestor of the rest, 860?-931?, the leader of a menacing band of Viking
1 CONT raiders. The Vikings set up their bases at the mouths of rivers. In 911 a
1 CONT large company of Vikings, under Rollo, accepted from King Charles the Simple
1 CONT  of France, the simple territory in the lower Seine Valley that became known
1 CONT as Normandy. Rollo, therefore, became the 1st Duke of Normandy. See Rollo.
