0 @N6000000003949726339@ NOTE "Vladimir was born by Malusha, the housekeeper of Olga, she was sister of  Dobrynya, their father was Malk of Lubech, and Dobrynya was Vladimir's  maternal uncle". This passage from "Tale of bygone years" (aka Nestor's 
1 CONT chronicle) contains all what is known about Vladimir's mother and her  ancestry. Everything else is speculation. 
