0 @N6000000002319313891@ NOTE Died: BEF 1013
1 CONT
1 CONT Around 996, Sveyn married Sigrid the Haughty, born in Sweden and the
1 CONT daughter of
1 CONT      Skogul-Tosti (born about 909). Sigrid had been married to Eric VI
1 CONT Bjornsson the Victorious,
1 CONT      King of Sweden and they had been the parents of Olaf Skootkonung
1 CONT of Sweden, King of
1 CONT      Sweden and Holmfrid Ericsdottir. Sigrid has also been associated
1 CONT with Vissavald of Kiev.
