1 CONT
1 CONT According to legend he was saintly and learned, dressed as a cleric, and said of Louis IV of France (who mocked his piety): "An illiterate king in a crowned ass."
1 CONT
1 CONT Source: Elizabeth Hallam, The Plantagenet Encyclopedia (NY: Crescent Books, 1996) 81.[Brøderbund WFT Vol. 2, Ed. 1, Tree #1241, Date of Import: May 8, 1997]
