1 CONT Edition, Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Co,   1988.
1 CONT Kilde: Count of Poitou [Ref: Weis AR   #144A].  Kilde: date: about 925
1 CONT [Ref: Weis AR #144A],  parents: [Ref: Weis AR #144A].
1 CONT Kilde: date: [Ref: Weis AR #144A].  Kilde: date: [Ref: Weis AR #144A].
1 CONT [Aardy R. DeVarque, <jhahn - at - nslsilus.org]: William I Pius
1 CONT 'Towhead',  Count of Poitiers, Duke (as III) of Aquitaine, Count of
1 CONT Auvergne.   Another  version gives, Ebles II, Duke of Aquitaine, d. 935,
1 CONT m.  Adela.
1 CONT [DC] William I (III) b. c. 925, De Poitou, Occ: Comte de Poitou, m.
1 CONT 935,  Gerloc, b. of Normandy, (d/o Rolf Ragnvaldsson and Poppa De Valois)
1 CONT d. aft 969.   William died 3 apr 963. Chuck Carpenter has him as William
1 CONT I (III),   towhead,  which Theroff writes as 'dit Tete d'Etoupe'. It is
1 CONT with this William   that the  numbering confusion begins. He was the 1st.
1 CONT Duke Wm. of Aquitaine of   his  family, but there had been 2 Duke
1 CONT Williams of the House of Autun;   thus the  original confusion.  Gerloc:
1 CONT this is in fact Adele of Normandy, d/o Rolf and Poppa . 2   children:
1 CONT William II (IV) b. 937,  and Adelaide b. 950/52
