0 @N6000000001783551939@ NOTE Daughter of Henry I the Fowler, and his wife Matilda of Ringelheim.
1 CONT
1 CONT She was a sister of Otto I, Holy Roman Emperor, Henry I, Duke of Bavaria, Gerberga of Saxony and Bruno I, Archbishop of Cologne.
1 CONT
1 CONT After her brother Otto I came to power, an alliance and marriage was arranged with Hugh the Great in 936. Her son, Hugh Capet, was crowned King of France in 987.
