1 CONT HAWKINS.GED says ABT 900 & place;members.aol.com/sargen3 says ABT 893 & place
1 CONT SOUR Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124 says 17 Dec 943;
1 CONT HAWKINS.GED says 17 Dec 943;
1 CONT The Conquest of England, Eric Linklater, p. 28 says 17 Dec 942
1 CONT SOUR Americans of Royal Descent, Charles H. Browning, p. 408;
1 CONT Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124
1 CONT William the Longsword - Americans of Royal Descent, Charles H. Browning, p. 25
1 CONT William Longue-epee - p. 30; Longespada - COMYN4.TAF (Compuserve Roots), p. 5;
1 CONT COMYNI.GED shows mother as Gisela de France. NORM.TAF shows Poppa.  I suspect
1 CONT these are the same people and one of the parents is incorrect - NLP; Guillaume
1 CONT "Longaspada" de Normandie - COMYNI.GED (Compuserve);The Norman Conquest also
1 CONT gives his mother as Poppa - NLP;GWALTNEY.ANC (Compuserve) gives Gisela - NLP
1 CONT WILLIAM I, son of ROLLO the DANE and POPPA DE BAYEUX: Before he added the Cotentin or Cherbourg, peninsula to his domain, he may have had to suppress a Breton rising there, and then a revolt of
1 CONT  recalcitrant Danes.  It is possible that he invited new
1 CONT Danish settlers to the Cotentin. He is said to have been a just and vigorous man, and in 942 he was murdered, at Picquigny on the Somme, by order of Arnulf of Flanders, who had forced a quarrel on
1 CONT  him in consequence of personal insult or some dispute
1 CONT about an
1 CONT intervening property - The Conquest of England, Eric Linklater, p. 28
1 CONT Aceded 932 - http://gendex.com/us ers/daver/rigney/D0002/G0000093.html#I1245
1 CONT
1 CONT OCCU 2nd Duke of Normandy...
1 CONT SOUR GWALTNEY.ANC (Compuserve);
1 CONT Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124 says c900;
1 CONT HAWKINS.GED says ABT 900 & place;members.aol.com/sargen3 says ABT 893 & place
1 CONT SOUR Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124 says 17 Dec 943;
1 CONT HAWKINS.GED says 17 Dec 943;
1 CONT The Conquest of England, Eric Linklater, p. 28 says 17 Dec 942
1 CONT SOUR Americans of Royal Descent, Charles H. Browning, p. 408;
1 CONT Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124
