0 @N6000000002240818143@ NOTE Note: Not confirmed by any reference sources as son of Rollo as of 1997. This
1 CONT is an assumed conclusion based upon the dates shown as to the reigns of
1 CONT Rollo, died c931, and the start of William I, duke of Normandy's reign, as
1 CONT being c930. Whether a brother of sister is involved in the passing of the
