0 @N6000000001503799880@ NOTE
1 CONT In 840 Giselbert became Count in Maasgau and, from 846 to 849, Count of Lommengau. He abducted Irmingard, daughter of the Emperor Lothar, and married her in Aquitaine before March 846. The Emperor eventually made peace with him, b
1 CONC ut only after the diet in Thionville in October 848. In 863 Giselbert also became Count of Darnau. He died after 14 July 877.
