0 @N6000000007329673551@ NOTE Kilde: Weis, Frederick Lewis, Ancestral   Roots  of  Sixty Colonists, 6th
1 CONT Edition, Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Co,   1988.
1 CONT Kilde: also known as Liegarde [Ref: Weis   AR  #48]  Kilde: parents:
1 CONT [Ref: Weis AR #48]  Kilde: names: [Ref: Weis AR #118] //  [ Alan Bond
1 CONT Wilson, <abwilson -at- uclink2.berkeley.edu> 1026   Alvarado  Road,
1 CONT Berleley, CA  94705-1548, (510) 848-6867]:
1 CONT I note that Winkhaus (p. 56) indicates that Hildebrande is the   daughter
1 CONT of  Robert I and Beatrix, whose parentage is unknown; and Moriarty (p. 9)
1 CONT indicates that Hildebrande may possibly be the daughter of Robert and
1 CONT his  second wife, Beatrice.
1 CONT Weis (line 48) indicates that Liegarde (Hildebrante) is daughter of
1 CONT Robert  I  and his first wife, Aelis; Robert's second wife, Beatrix, is
1 CONT the   daughter of  Herbert I, Count of Vermandois.  Stuart (line 169)
1 CONT also  indicates   that  Hildebrante is daughter of Robert's first wife
1 CONT Adele  (Aenis) and   that  Robert's second wife, Beatrice, is daughter of
1 CONT Herbert I,  Count of   Vermandois  (line 134).
1 CONT In Europaische Stammtafeln (ii, 10) Hildebrante (Liegarde), wife of
1 CONT Heribert  II, Count of Vermandois, is listed as daughter of Robert's
1 CONT first   wife, Aelis;  Robert's second wife, Beatrix de Vermandois is
1 CONT mother of  Hugues le   Grand.
1 CONT Elsewhere (line 259) Stuart lists Adele (Adelaide), wife of Robert I,
1 CONT as  daughter of Louis I, King of France, and Ermengarde of Hesbaye.
1 CONT Stuart  provides three references to line 259.  One of them, Moriarty
1 CONT (pp. 6   & 9)  does not mention Adele (Aelis/Aenis/Adelaide); I have not
1 CONT tracked   down the  other two references.
1 CONT It would seem that it was Robert's first wife, Adele (or something   like
1 CONT that), not Beatrix, who was Hildebrante's mother, but the critical
1 CONT connection  between this Adele and Robert I relies on Stuart's line 259
1 CONT which I   have not  independently  confirmed.
0 @N6000000007329714865@ NOTE [DC] 1st. or second wife, Adele, and had Alice of Vermandois m.   Arnolph
