0 @N6000000003495155084@ NOTE
1 CONT Rollo Ragnvaldsson, 1st Duc de Normandie1 (M)
1 CONT b. circa 846, d. circa 931, #104767
1 CONT Pedigree
1 CONT Last Edited=20 Aug 2005
1 CONT
1 CONT      Rollo Ragnvaldsson, 1st Duc de Normandie was born circa 846 in Maer, Norway.3 He was the son of Ragnvald I 'the Wise' Eysteinsson, Earl of More and Ragnhild Hrolfsdottir.2 He was also reported to have been born in 870 in Norw
1 CONC ay. He married, firstly, Poppa of Normandy de Valois, daughter of Berenger of Bayeaux de Senlis, Count of Bayeaux, in 886.2 He married, secondly, Gisela, daughter of Charles III, Roi de France and Frederuna, in 912.2 He died circa
1 CONC  931 in Rouen, Normandy, France.3 
1 CONT      Rollo Ragnvaldsson, 1st Duc de Normandie was also known as Rolf. He was created 1st Duc de Normandie in 911.1
1 CONT
1 CONT Children of Rollo Ragnvaldsson, 1st Duc de Normandie and Poppa of Normandy de Valois
1 CONT Robert of Corbeil 2
1 CONT Crespina de Normandie 2
1 CONT Gerletta de Normandie 2
1 CONT Kathlin de Normandie 2
1 CONT Guillaume I 'Longsword', 2nd Duc de Normandie+ b. c 900, d. 17 Dec 9422
1 CONT Adele de Normandie+ b. c 917, d. a 14 Oct 9622
