0 @N6000000000232601897@ NOTE ==========
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert I, Count of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT This article does not cite any references or sources. (August 2007)
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert I of Vermandois (c. 848/850 – 907), Count of Vermandois, lord of Senlis, of Peronne and of Saint Quentin, was the son of Pepin of Vermandois.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit] Marriage and issue
1 CONT
1 CONT He married Bertha de Morvois. They had the following:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Herbert II of Vermandois (c. 880-943)
1 CONT     * Béatrice of Vermandois (c. 880-931), married King Robert I of France.
1 CONT     * Cunigunde of Vermandois (d. 943)
1 CONT     * Adele of Vermandois
1 CONT     * Berenger of Vermandois, Count of Bayeaux whose grandson was Conan I of Rennes.
1 CONT
1 CONT ==========
