0 @N6000000002187572334@ NOTE Herbert I of Vermandois
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert I of Vermandois (ca. 848/850 – 907), Count of Vermandois, senior of Senlis, of Peronne and of Saint Quentin. He was son of Pepin of Vermandois.
1 CONT
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Family and children
1 CONT He was married Bertha de Morvois. They children were:
1 CONT
1 CONT Beatrix of Vermandois (880–931), married King Robert I of France. 
1 CONT Berenger of Vermandois, Count of Bayeaux. 
1 CONT Herbert II of Vermandois. 
1 CONT a daughter (ca 882 – 12 December 949), married 918 Udo/Eldo von Wetterau (d. 2 December 949). 
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT ? Count of Vermandois
1 CONT 896–907 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Herbert II 
