0 @N6000000003495151672@ NOTE
1 CONT Herbert I of Vermandois (ca. 848/850 – 907), Count of Vermandois, lord of Senlis, of Peronne and of Saint Quentin, was the son of Pepin of Vermandois.
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT
1 CONT Family and children
1 CONT He married Bertha de Morvois. Their children were:
1 CONT 1. Beatrix of Vermandois (880–931), married King Robert I of France.
1 CONT 2. Berenger of Vermandois, Count of Bayeaux.
1 CONT 3. Herbert II of Vermandois.
1 CONT 4. a daughter (ca 882 – 12 December 949), married 918 Udo/Eldo von Wetterau (d. 2 December 949).
