0 @N6000000007329688812@ NOTE Kilde: Weis, Frederick Lewis, Ancestral   Roots  of  Sixty Colonists, 6th
1 CONT Edition, Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Co,   1988.
1 CONT Kilde: Wurts, John S., Magna Charta: The   Pedigrees  of the Barons,
1 CONT Philadelphia, PA: Brookfield Publishing Co, 1942.
1 CONT Kilde: Count of Vermandois, Seigneur of   Senlis,  Peronne and St.
1 CONT Quentin [Ref: Weis AR #50]
1 CONT Kilde: date: [Ref: Weis AR #50], father:   [Ref:  Weis  AR #50]
1 CONT Kilde: names: [Ref: Weis AR #50]  FAMILY MARRIAGE RESEARCH NOTES: names:
1 CONT Herbert I & a daughter of   Robert  le  Fort [Ref: Wurts p420]
1 CONT Kilde: date: murdered about 902 [Ref: Weis AR   #50]  [ Pat(ricia) Boren,
1 CONT <pboren at- rand.org.]: James A. Stevens   <GEN-MEDIEVAL  -at-
1 CONT mail.eworld.com> wrote:  Alan Wilson wrote on 10 Nov  1995 :   (snip)
1 CONT 5.  Herbert I de VERMANDOIS Count (Circa 840 - 902) & Beatrice   (Bertha)
1 CONT of  Morvois.
1 CONT QUESTION : The 'Dictionary of Royal Lineage' gives Herbert's wife as
1 CONT RICHILDE,  dau of ROBERT 'THE STRONG' (D.866) son of Theotbert, son of
1 CONT Nivelon   I, son of  Childebrand I (brother of Charles Martel), son of
1 CONT Pepin of Heristal.   Does  this theory have any support ?
1 CONT This seems all wrong.  I too have Heribert's wife as Bertha de   Morvois,
1 CONT daughter of Guerri I (Count of Morvois) and Eve of Roussillon.
1 CONT As for Robert the Strong, Weis lines 48 and 53 show his ancestry as
1 CONT from the  Counts of Wormgau:
1 CONT LAMBERT II (d. by 741), father of RUTPERT I, Count in the Upper Rhine
1 CONT and  Wormgau.  'The name Rutpert is often used interchangeably with
1 CONT Robert.'   He  married Williswint, daughter of Count Adelheim, and had a
1 CONT son,   THURINGBERT,  father of RUTPERT II, Count in the Upper Rhine and
1 CONT Wormgau.   He   married first  Theoderata (d. by 789) and second
1 CONT Isingard.  A son by the first   marriage  was  RUTPERT III, Count in
1 CONT Wormgau.  He was the second husband of   Wialdruth,  whom  some consider
1 CONT a daughter of St. William, Count of Toulouse (d. 812).   Their  son was
1 CONT RUTPERT IV (ROBERT THE STRONG), Count in Wormgau, of Anjou,   Blois,
1 CONT Auxerre, and Nevers.  His second wife was Aelis (or Adelaide) of   Tours
1 CONT and  Alsace.  Children:  Odo (king of Franks) and Robert I (Count of
1 CONT Paris, father  of Hugh the Great). Comments?
0 @N6000000009304938770@ NOTE #Générale#Comte de Vermandois.
0 @N6000000003796242420@ NOTE Charlemagne The Great (Descendants)
1 CONT URL:  http://www3.sympatico.ca/robert.sewell/charlemagne.html
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation Seventeen
1 CONT Hubert (I), Count of Senlis and Vermandois
1 CONT
1 CONT Born about 850
1 CONT Died in 900
1 CONT Hubert (I) had the following children:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Sprota or Adela of Senlis who married William (I) Longsword 2nd Duke of Normandy as his first wife.  Click on William Longsword for this line.
1 CONT     * Herbert (II), Count of Vermandois
1 CONT     * Beatrice de Vermandois, born in 880, who married Robert (I), King of France.  Please click on Robert (I), King of France for this descent.
1 CONT     * a daughter
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation Eighteen
1 CONT Herbert (II) de Vermandois
1 CONT
1 CONT Herbert (II) was associated with Adela, and they had the following children:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Odo, Count of Amiens, born 910
1 CONT     * Alice of Vermandois, born 910, who associated herself with Arnolph "the Great", Count of Flanders. Please click on Alice of Vermandois for this line.
1 CONT     * Herbert the Elder, Count of Meaux & Troyes, born circa 910
1 CONT     * Robert, Count of Troyes, born about 910
1 CONT     * Adalbert, Count of Vermandois
1 CONT     * Luitgarda of Vermandois, born about 915 who married William (I) Longsword 2nd Duke of Normandy as his second wife.  See William Longsword.
1 CONT     * Hugh, Archbishop of Rheims, born 920
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation Nineteen
1 CONT Adalbert, Count of Vermandois who is also known as Albert, Count of Vermandois.
1 CONT Born circa 915
1 CONT Died in 987
1 CONT Adalbert associated with Gerberga of Lorraine.  Click on The Merovingians for Gerberga's descent from Clovis and the Merovingian Kings.
1 CONT Adalbert and Gerberga had the following sons:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Herbert (III), Count of Vermandois
1 CONT     * Liudolf, Bishop of Noyon, born 957
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Generation Twenty
1 CONT Herbert (III), Count of Vermandois
1 CONT
1 CONT Born circa 954
1 CONT Died about 1000
1 CONT Herbert was associated with Ermengard and they had a son:
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Odo
1 CONT
1 CONT
