1 CONT     HIST FLANDERS WAS INHABITED BY CELTS IN THE 1ST CENTURY BC AND CONQUERED BY GERMANIC TRIBES IN THE NEXT SEVERAL HUNDRED YEARS,FINALLY BECOMING PART OF THE HOLY ROMAN EMPIRE ESTABLISHED BY CHARLEMAGNE
1 CONT     IN THE 9TH CENTURY AD. ABOUT 862, BALDWIN I,
1 CONT     DATE 27 APR 2000
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: Odescer Of FLANDERS b: 810 in Flanders, Nord, France
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Judith Of FRANCE b: ABT 843 in Frankfort - dtr of Charles the Bald
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Married: 862 in (Her 3rd marriage) 1 2 3 4 5 
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Has Children Winilda Of FLANDERS b: 862 in Flanders, Belgium
1 CONT    2. Has Children Raoul CAMBRAY b: APR 864
1 CONT    3. Has Children Count Of Flanders BALDWIN II b: ABT 865 in Flanders, Artois
1 CONT
1 CONT
