1 CONT influence into Burgundy  when the Burgundian Princess Adelaide was taken
1 CONT prisoner by the margrave Berengar of Ivrea in 951. When she appealed to him
1 CONT for help, Otto marched into Italy , assumed the title of King of the Lombards,
