1 CONT Emperor: 875-877
1 CONT Coronation King of Aquitaine: 6 June 848, Orleans;
1 CONT King of Lotharingia: 9 September 869, Metz;
1 CONT Emperor: 25 December 875, Rome
1 CONT Titles King of Aquitaine (838-855);
1 CONT King of Italy (875-877)
1 CONT Born June 13, 823(823-06-13)
1 CONT Birthplace Frankfurt, Germany
1 CONT Died October 6, 877 (aged 54)
1 CONT Place of death Avrieux, France
1 CONT Predecessor In Western Francia: Louis the Pious;
1 CONT in the Empire, Emperor Louis II
1 CONT Successor In Western Francia: Louis the Stammerer;
1 CONT In the Empire, Charles the Fat
