1 CONT     * Grimoald (616–656)
1 CONT     * Childebert the Adopted (d. 662)
1 CONT
1 CONT Arnulfings
1 CONT
1 CONT     * Arnulf of Metz (582–640)
1 CONT     * Chlodulf of Metz (d. 696 or 697)
1 CONT     * Ansegisel (c.602–before 679)
1 CONT     * Pippin the Middle (c.635–714)
1 CONT     * Grimoald II (d. 714)
